<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Jean</para>
  <para style="toc1">LEVANJIL SELON JEAN</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jean</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">LEVANJIL SELON JEAN</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Nan kòmansman, te gen Pawòl la, e Pawòl la te avèk Bondye, e Pawòl la te Bondye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:5">Jn 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Li te nan kòmansman avèk Bondye. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:10">Jn 1:10</ref></char></note>Tout bagay ki te fèt te fèt pa Li, epi san Li, anyen ki te fèt pa t vin fèt. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:26">Jn 5:26</ref></char></note>Nan Li se te lavi, epi lavi se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref></char></note>limyè a lòm. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:19">Jn 3:19</ref></char></note>Limyè fè klè nan tenèb la, epi tenèb la pa t ka venk li.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat 3:1</ref></char></note>vin parèt yon nonm ke Bondye te voye ke yo te rele Jean. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Li te vini kon yon temwen, pou li ta kapab fè temwen a limyè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Jn 1:12</ref></char></note>pou tout moun ta kapab kwè akoz li menm. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref></char></note>li ki te Limyè a, men li te vini pou li ta kapab fè temwen a Limyè a.<verse eid="JHN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:8">I Jn 2:8</ref></char></note>vrè Limyè a ke, lè l vini nan mond lan, klere tout moun. <verse eid="JHN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Li te nan lemond, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:6">I Kor 8:6</ref></char></note>lemond te fèt pa Li, men lemond pa t rekonèt Li. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Li te vini a moun pa Li yo, e moun pa L yo pa t resevwa Li. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Men a tout sa yo ki te resevwa L, Li te bay yo pouvwa pou devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:52">Jn 11:52</ref></char></note>pitit a Bondye, menm a sa yo ki kwè nan non Li, <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Jn 3:5</ref></char></note>ki pa t fèt ni pa san, ni pa volonte lachè a, ni pa volonte a lòm, men pa Bondye.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>E pawòl la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2:7</ref></char></note>vin lachè, e te viv pami nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:32">Luc 9:32</ref></char></note>Nou te wè glwa Li, kon glwa a sèl Fis inik a Papa a, ranpli avèk gras ak verite.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Jean te fè temwen a Li. Li te rele fò e te di: “Sa se Li menm de moun mwen te pale nou lè m te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>‘Sila ki vini aprè mwen an pi wo pase m, paske li te egziste avan m.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Paske nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ef 1:23</ref></char></note>plenitid Li, nou tout te resevwa gras sou gras. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:19">Jn 7:19</ref></char></note>Lalwa te bay pa Moïse, men nou te resevwa gras ak verite pa Jésus Kris. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Pèsòn pa janm wè Bondye. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:18">18</ref></char></note>Fis inik la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:22">Luc 16:22</ref></char></note>ki nan sen Papa L, te fè nou konnen L.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>E sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:7">Jn 1:7</ref></char></note>temwayaj a Jean, lè Jwif yo te voye prèt yo avèk Levit yo pou mande l “Ki moun ou ye?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Li te konfese, li pa t nye, men li te konfese:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:20">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:15">Luc 3:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen menm se pa Kris la.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Konsa yo mande li: “E byen, kisa?” Èske ou menm se Elie?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:21">Li te di: “Non mwen pa Li.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:21">“Èske ou menm se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Det 18:15-18</ref></char></note>Pwofèt la?” Li te reponn: “Non.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Konsa yo di l: “Kilès ou ye, pou nou kapab bay yon repons a sa ki te voye nou yo? Kisa ou di selon ou menm?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Li te di: “Mwen menm se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">És 40:3</ref></char></note>yon vwa k ap kriye nan savann nan, ‘Fè chemen Bondye a dwat’, kon pwofèt la, Ésaïe te di.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Alò, se te Farizyen yo ki te voye yo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>E yo te mande l, e te di l: “Ebyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Det 18:15-18</ref></char></note>poukisa w ap batize si se pa Kris la, ni Elie, ni Pwofèt la ou ye?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Jean te reponn yo konsa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>“Mwen batize nou avèk dlo, men pami nou, kanpe youn ke nou pa konnen. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Se Li menm k ap vin apre mwen, ki prefere avan m, e menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>lasèt a sandal Li, mwen pa dign pou m ta demare.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Bagay sa yo te fèt nan Béthanie, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:26">Jn 3:26</ref></char></note>lòtbò Jourdain an, kote Jean t ap batize a.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Nan jou aprè li te wè Jésus ki t ap vin kote l e te di: “Men gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">És 53:7</ref></char></note>Jenn Mouton Bondye a k ap retire peche mond lan. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Se te anfavè Li ke mwen te pale a lè mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>‘Sila ki vini aprè mwen an pi wo pase m, paske li te egziste avan m.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Epi mwen pa t rekonèt Li, men se pou Li ta kapab fè parèt a Israël, ke m te vini pou batize moun avèk dlo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Jean te fè temwayaj epi te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3:16</ref></char></note>“Mwen wè Lespri a vin desann kon yon toutrèl ki soti nan syèl la epi Li te rete sou Li. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Mwen pa t rekonèt Li, men sila a ki te voye m pou batize avèk dlo te di mwen, ‘Li menm sou kilès ou wè Lespri a desann epi rete sou Li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>se Li menm k ap batize avèk Lespri Sen an.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Mwen wè, epi mwen fè temwayaj ke sila a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:3">Mat 4:3</ref></char></note>Fis Bondye a.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Jn 1:29</ref></char></note>jou aprè Jean te kanpe avèk de nan disip li yo, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>epi li te gade Jésus pandan Li t ap mache. Li te di: “Men gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Jn 1:29</ref></char></note>Jenn Mouton Bondye a!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>De disip yo te tande l pale, epi yo te swiv Jésus.<verse eid="JHN 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Konsa, Jésus te vire pou wè yo t ap swiv Li, e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Kisa n ap chache”? </char> Yo te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Rabbi, ki tradwi vle di ‘Mèt’, se kibò w ap rete?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Vini, nou va wè.” </char> Pou sa yo te vini epi te wè kote Li t ap rete. Yo te rete avèk Li jou sa, paske li te vè dizyèm lè.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:18-25">Mat 4:18-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Youn nan de sa yo ki te tande Jean pale epi te swiv Li yo se te Andre, frè a Simon Pierre. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Li te twouve premyèman frè li, Simon, e te di Li: “Nou te twouve Mesi a, ki tradwi se Kris la.”<verse eid="JHN 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Li te mennen li kote Jésus. Jésus te gade li e te di: <char style="wj">“Ou se Simon, </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:17">Mat 16:17</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">fis a Jean. Ou va rele Céphas,” </char> ki tradwi vle di Pierre.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Jou apre Li te vle antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:12">Mat 4:12</ref></char></note>Galilée, e Li te twouve Philippe. Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Swiv mwen.” </char><verse eid="JHN 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Philippe te sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:21">Mat 11:21</ref></char></note>Bethsaïda, vil André avèk Pierre a. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Philippe te twouve Nathanaël, e te di l: “Nou te twouve sila a ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luc 24:27</ref></char></note>Moïse nan Lalwa avèk pwofèt yo te ekri a, Jésus de Nazareth, fis a Joseph la.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nathanaël te di l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:41-52">Jn 7:41-52</ref></char></note>“Èske yon bon bagay kapab sòti nan Nazareth?” Philippe te reponn: “Vini pou wè.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Jésus te wè Nathanaël t ap vin kote Li epi te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:12">Wo 9:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Men gade, yon Izrayelit nan kilès pa gen desepsyon.” </char><verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nathanaël te di L “Kijan ou fè rekonèt mwen?” Jésus te reponn li: <char style="wj">“Avan </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:3">Mat 10:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Philippe te rele ou, pandan ou te anba pye figye a, Mwen te wè ou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanaël te reponn Li: “Rabbi, ki vle di ‘Mèt’, Ou menm se Fis Bondye a. Ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:2">Mat 2:2</ref></char></note>Wa Israël la.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Jésus te reponn Li e te di: <char style="wj">“Akoz Mwen te wè ou anba pye figye a, ou kwè? W ap wè pi gwo bagay pase sa yo.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>E Li te di li: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite mwen di ou, w ap wè </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:1">Éz 1:1</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">syèl yo louvri, epi zanj Bondye yo k ap monte desann sou Fis a Lòm nan.” </char><verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Nan twazyèm jou a, te gen yon fèt maryaj nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11">Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>Cana nan Galilée, e manman a Jésus te la. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Jésus ansanm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:40-49">Jn 1:40-49</ref></char></note>disip li yo te envite nan maryaj la.<verse eid="JHN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Lè diven an te fini, manman a Jésus te di Li: “Nanpwen diven ankò.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Fanm, kisa mwen gen avèk ou? </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:6-8">Jn 7:6-8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Lè M poko rive.” </char><verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:46">Mat 12:46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Manman li te di sèvitè yo: “Nenpòt sa Li mande nou, fè l.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>La te genyen sis gwo veso dlo fèt an wòch pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:3">Mc 7:3</ref></char></note>koutim Jwif la ke yo rele pirifikasyon, ki te kenbe ven a trant galon chak.<verse eid="JHN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Ranpli po yo avèk dlo.” </char> Konsa, yo te plen yo ra bouch.<verse eid="JHN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Epi Li di yo: <char style="wj">“Retire kèk pou pote bay chèf sèvitè tab yo.” </char>Konsa yo te pote bay li.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Lè chèf sèvitè a te goute dlo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:46">Jn 4:46</ref></char></note>ki te tounen diven, li pa t konnen kote li te soti. Men sevitè ki te rale l yo te konnen. Konsa, Chèf sèvitè a te rele jennonm ki t ap marye a, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>epi te di l: “Tout moun sèvi bon diven an avan, e lè moun yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:49">Mat 24:49</ref></char></note>bwè kont yo, yo bay sa ki enferyè a, men ou kenbe bon diven an jis koulye a.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Sa se te premye nan mirak pa L yo ke Li te fè nan Cana nan Galilée, e te montre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note>glwa Li, epi disip Li yo te kwè nan Li.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Aprè sa Li te desann bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat 4:13</ref></char></note>Capernaüm, Li ansanm avèk manman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:46">Mat 12:46</ref></char></note>Li, avèk Frè Li yo, ak disip Li yo. Epi yo te rete la pou kèk jou.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:1-6">Det 16:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pak Jwif la te rive e Jésus te monte nan Jérusalem.<verse eid="JHN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te jwenn nan tanp lan, sa yo ki t ap vann bèf, mouton, ak toutrèl, avèk sa ki te chita pou fè echanj lajan yo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Konsa, Li te fè yon fwèt avèk kòd, pou te chase yo tout fè yo sòti nan tanp lan, ansanm ak mouton ak bèf yo. Li te vide kòb a sa ki t ap chanje lajan yo, epi te chavire tab yo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>A sa yo ki t ap vann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mat 21:12</ref></char></note>toutrèl yo Li te di: <char style="wj">“Pran bagay sa yo ale. Sispann fè lakay Papa M yon kay mache lavant.” </char><verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:2">Jn 2:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Disip Li yo te sonje ke li te ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Sòm 69:9</ref></char></note>“Zèl pou lakay Ou va devore M.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Konsa, Jwif yo te reponn e te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref></char></note>“Ki sign otorite ou montre nou, pou dwa fè bagay sa yo?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:49">Mat 24:49</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Detwi tanp sila a, epi nan twa jou Mwen va fè l kanpe ankò.” </char><verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Jwif yo te reponn: “Li te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:16">Esd 5:16</ref></char></note>karant-sis ane pou bati tanp sa, epi Ou va fè l kanpe nan twa jou?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Men Li t ap pale sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">I Kor 6:19</ref></char></note>tanp kò Li a. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Akoz sa, lè Li te leve sòti nan lanmò a, disip Li yo te sonje sa, e yo te kwè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sòm 16:10</ref></char></note>Ekriti Sen yo, avèk pawòl ke Jésus te pale a.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Alò, lè L te nan Jérusalem, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:13">Jn 2:13</ref></char></note>Pak Jwif la, pandan fèt la, anpil te kwè nan non Li, paske yo te wè sign ke Li t ap fè yo.<verse eid="JHN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Men Jésus, pou pati pa L, pa t fè yo konfyans paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:24">Trav 1:24</ref></char></note>Li te konnen tout moun. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Konsa, Li pa t bezwen pèsòn pou bay temwayaj sou lòm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:4">Mat 9:4</ref></char></note>paske li te konnen Li menm sa ki te nan lòm.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Te genyen yon mesye pami Farizyen yo ke yo te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:50">Jn 7:50</ref></char></note>Nicodème, yon chèf a Jwif yo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Mesye sila a te vin kote Li pandan lannwit epi te di L: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Rabbi, nou konnen ke ou sòti nan Bondye kon yon Mèt. Paske pèsòn pa kapab fè sign sa yo ke nou wè ou fè yo anmwenske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:33">Jn 9:33</ref></char></note>Bondye avè L.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Jésus te reponn e te di: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di ou, anmwenske yon moun </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:7">II Kor 5:7</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">ne ankò, li p ap kapab wè wayòm syèl la.” </char><verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nicodème te di Li: “Kijan yon moun kapab ne lè li vin vye? Èske li kapab antre yon dezyèm fwa nan vant manman l pou l kapab fèt ankò?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Jésus te reponn li <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di ou, anmwenske yon moun fèt pa dlo, epi pa Lespri, li p ap kapab antre nan wayòm syèl la.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:13">Jn 1:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sa ki ne nan lachè se lachè, men sa ki ne nan Lespri, se Lespri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/><char style="wj">Pa etone ke Mwen te di ou: ‘Fòk ou ne tounèf.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:7">Sòm 135:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Van an soufle kote li vle, epi ou tande son li, men ou pa konnen kote li soti, ni kote li prale. Se konsa li ye avèk tout sa yo ki ne nan Lespri.” </char><verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nicodème te reponn Li: “Kijan bagay sa yo kapab ye?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Jésus te reponn: <char style="wj">“Ou menm se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:46">Luc 2:46</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mèt an Israël epi ou pa konprann bagay sa yo? </char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/><char style="wj">Anverite, anverite, Mwen di ou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou pale sa ke nou konnen, e fè temwayaj de sa ke nou konn wè, e ou pa aksepte temwayaj nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Si Mwen di ou bagay konsènan latè a, epi ou pa konprann, kijan w ap kwè si Mwen di ou bagay konsènan syèl la.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 30:4">Pwov 30:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nanpwen pèsòn ki monte nan syèl la sof ke Li menm ki te desann sòti nan syèl la, Fis a Lòm nan menm.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Menm jan </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:19">Nonb 2:19</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Moïse te leve sèpan an nan dezè a, konsa fòk Fis a Lòm nan </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:34">Jn 12:34</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">vin leve wo,</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/><char style="wj">pou nenpòt moun ki kwè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">Jn 20:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nan Li, kapab genyen lavi etènèl. </char><verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske Bondye te</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:8">Wo 5:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tèlman renmen lemond, ke Li te bay sèl Fis inik Li pou nenpòt moun ki kwè nan Li pa ta peri, men ta gen lavi etènèl.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/><char style="wj">Paske Bondye pa t voye Fis Li nan lemond pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luc 19:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jije lemond, men pou lemond ta kapab sove pa Li.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki kwè nan Li p ap jije. Men li menm ki pa kwè nan Li gen tan jije deja, paske Li pa t kwè nan non a </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">sèl Fis inik a Bondye a.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sa se jijman an, ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">limyè a te vini nan lemond, men lòm te renmen tenèb la olye limyè a. Paske zèv pa yo te mechan. </char><verse eid="JHN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:20-21">Jn 3:20-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Paske chak moun ki fè mal, li rayi limyè a, e pa vin kote limyè a, akoz perèz zèv li yo ta vin parèt</char>. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/><char style="wj">Men sila ki </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:6">I Jn 1:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">aji nan verite a, ap vini vè limyè a, pou zèv li yo kapab parèt kon zèv ki te fèt pa Bondye.” </char><verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Apre bagay sa yo, Jésus avèk disip Li yo te vini nan peyi Judée, e la Li t ap pase tan avèk yo epi t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:1-2">Jn 4:1-2</ref></char></note>batize.<verse eid="JHN 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Konsa, Jean osi t ap batize nan Enon, toupre Salim, paske te gen anpil dlo la. E yo t ap vini e t ap batize. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:12">Mat 4:12</ref></char></note>Jean potko jete nan prizon.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Konsa, te leve yon diskisyon antre disip a Jean yo ak yon Jwif sou afè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:6">Jn 2:6</ref></char></note>pirifikasyon. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Yo te vin kote Jean pou di l, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Rabbi, Li menm ki te avèk ou lòtbò Jourdain an, pou Li menm ke ou te bay temwayaj la. Gade, l ap batize, e tout moun ap vin kote Li.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Jean te reponn e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:7">I Kor 4:7</ref></char></note>“Yon nonm pa kapab resevwa anyen anmwenske li sòti nan syèl la. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Nou menm se temwen m lè mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20-23">Jn 1:20-23</ref></char></note>‘Mwen menm se pa Kris la, men m te voye devan Li.’<verse eid="JHN 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>“Sa ki genyen madanm maryaj la se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:15">Mat 9:15</ref></char></note>jennonm k ap marye. Zanmi li an ki kanpe epi tande l, rejwi anpil paske li tande vwa li. Konsa jwa pa m fin ranpli. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Li menm oblije vin plis, men mwen oblije vin mwens.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li ki sòti pa anwo a, se anwo tout bagay. Li menm ki soti sou latè, se pou latè, epi pale sou zafè latè. Li menm ki sòti nan syèl la, anwo tout bagay.<verse eid="JHN 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Sa ke Li te wè epi tande, se sou sa Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:11">Jn 3:11</ref></char></note>bay temwayaj. Epi pa gen pèsòn ki resevwa temwayaj Li. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Sila ki resevwa temwayaj Li mete so li sou sa, ke Bondye vrè. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Paske Li menm ke Bondye voye a, pale pawòl a Bondye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat 12:18</ref></char></note>Paske Li bay Lespri a san mezi.<verse eid="JHN 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Papa a renmen Fis la, epi te mete tout bagay nan men Li.<verse eid="JHN 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note>kwè nan Fis la genyen lavi etènèl; men sila li ki pa obeyi Fis la, p ap wè lavi, men lakolè Bondye va rete sou li.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Pou sa, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:13">Luc 7:13</ref></char></note>Senyè a te konnen Farizyen yo te tande Jésus t ap batize plis disip pase Jean <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>(men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:22-26">Jn 3:22-26</ref></char></note>Jésus Li menm pa t ap batize, men disip Li yo t ap fè l), <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>li te kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:22">Jn 3:22</ref></char></note>Judée epi te pati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11">Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>ankò pou Galilée. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Konsa, Li te oblije pase nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:52">Luc 9:52</ref></char></note>Samarie.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Li te vini nan yon vil Samarie yo rele Sychar, toupre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Jen 33:19</ref></char></note>moso tè ke Jacob te bay a Joseph, fis li. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Pwi a Jacob la te la. Jésus, akoz Li te byen fatige pa vwayaj la, te chita akote pwi a. Se te anviwon sizyèm lè.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Yon fanm Samariten te vini pou tire dlo nan pwi a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:7">Jésus te di l: “Ban M bwè”. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:2">Jn 2:2</ref></char></note>disip li yo te ale nan vil la pou achte manje.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Konsa, fanm Samariten nan te reponn Li: “Kòman Ou menm, ki se yon Jwif mande M pou bwè lè mwen menm se yon fanm Samariten?” (Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:3-11">Esd 4:3-11</ref></char></note>Jwif yo pa gen bon relasyon avèk Samariten yo.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Jésus te reponn e te di l: <char style="wj">“Si ou te konnen don Bondye a, epi ki moun ki di ou ‘Ban M bwè a’, ou t ap mande L, e Li t ap bay ou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:13">Jr 2:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">dlo vivan an.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Li te di L: “Mesye, ou pa gen anyen pou rale l, epi pwi a fon. Ki kote konsa W ap twouve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:13">Jr 2:13</ref></char></note>dlo vivan sila a? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Èske Ou kapab pi gran pase papa zansèt nou yo Jacob, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:6">Jn 4:6</ref></char></note>bay nou pwi a, ki te bwè ladann li menm, avèk pitit li, ak bèt li yo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Jésus te reponn e te di li: <char style="wj">“Tout moun ki bwè dlo sila a ap swaf ankò: </char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/><char style="wj">Men nenpòt moun ki bwè dlo ke Mwen bay li a, p ap janm swaf. Men dlo ke Mwen bay li a ap vini nan li tankou yon pwi k ap bay dlo jiska</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:46">Mat 25:46</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lavi etènèl.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Fanm nan te di Li: “Mesye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:35">Jn 6:35</ref></char></note>ban m dlo sa a pou m pa swaf, ni pou m pa oblije vin jis isit la pou tire l.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Li te di li: <char style="wj">“Ale rele Mari ou, epi vin isit la.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Fanm nan te reponn Li e te di: “Mwen pa gen mari.” Jésus te di li: “Ou pale byen: <char style="wj">‘Mwen pa gen mari.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/><char style="wj">Paske ou te genyen senk mari, epi sila a ke ou gen koulye a se pa mari ou. Ou pale verite.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Fanm nan te reponn Li: “Mesye mwen konsidere ke Ou menm se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:11">Mat 21:11</ref></char></note>yon pwofèt. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Papa zansèt nou yo te adore nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Det 11:29</ref></char></note>mòn sila a, men ou di ke se nan Jérusalem pou nou adore.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Fanm, kwè M, yon lè ap vini lè se pa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mal 1:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ni nan mòn sa a, ni nan Jérusalem ke ou va adore Papa a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/><char style="wj">Ou adore sa ke ou pa konnen, men nou adore sa ke nou konnen, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">És 2:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sali a sòti nan Jwif yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:21">Jn 4:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">lè ap vini, e gen tan rive koulye a, lè vrè adoratè yo, va adore Papa a an espri, e anverite. Pwiske se moun konsa ke Papa a ap chache pou adore L</char>. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/><char style="wj">Bondye se lespri, e fòk sa yo ki adore Li, adore L</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:3">Fil 3:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">an espri e anverite.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Fanm nan te di L: “Mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:25">Dan 9:25</ref></char></note>Mesye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:16">Mat 1:16</ref></char></note>(sila a ke yo rele Kris la) gen pou vini. Lè L vini, L ap deklare nou tout bagay.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Jésus te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:24-28">Jn 8:24-28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mwen Menm k ap pale avèk ou a se Li.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Nan moman sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:8">Jn 4:8</ref></char></note>disip Li yo te vini. Yo te etone ke Li t ap pale avèk yon fanm, men pèsòn pa t mande l: “Kisa w ap chache” ni “Poukisa w ap pale avè L.”<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Konsa fanm nan te kite po dlo a e te antre nan vil la. Konsa, li te di a tout moun: <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Vin wè yon nonm ki te di mwen tout bagay ke mwen fè. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:23">Mat 12:23</ref></char></note>Nou pa sipoze ke se Li menm ki Kris la?”<verse eid="JHN 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Yo te kite lavil la e t ap vin kote l.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Antre tan, disip yo t ap di L: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Rabbi, manje.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Men Li te di yo: “Mwen gen manje ke nou pa konnen.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Pou sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:13-16">Luc 6:13-16</ref></char></note>disip yo t ap di a youn lòt: “Èske ou kwè ke moun pote bay Li kèk bagay pou L manje?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Manje M se pou fè volonte a Papa M ki voye Mwen an, e pou </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:36">Jn 5:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">acheve travay Li a.</char><verse eid="JHN 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Èske nou pa konn di: ‘Genyen toujou kat mwa, epi rekòlt la ap vini?’ Gade, Mwen di nou leve zye nou epi gade chan yo. Yo blan avèk</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat 9:37-38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">rekòlt la.</char><verse eid="JHN 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Deja sila a ki fè rekòlt la ap resevwa salè li, e l ap ranmase fwi pou </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:29">Mat 9:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">lavi etènèl. Pou sila ki simen an, ak sila ki rekòlte a kapab rejwi ansanm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/><char style="wj">Paske nan sila a, pwovèb la vrè:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 31:8">Job 31:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Youn ap simen epi yon lòt ap rekòlte.’</char><verse eid="JHN 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen te voye nou pou rekòlte kote nou pa t simen. Se lòt ki te travay, epi nou te antre nan travay yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Anpil nan Samariten ki sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:5-30">Jn 4:5-30</ref></char></note>vil sa a te kwè nan Li, akoz pawòl yo ke fanm nan te bay kon temwayaj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:29">Jn 4:29</ref></char></note>“Li te di mwen tout bagay ke mwen fè”. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Lè Samariten yo te vin kote L, yo t ap mande Li pou rete avèk yo. Li te rete la pou de jou.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Anpil anplis te kwè nan Li akoz pawòl Li. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Yo t ap di a fanm nan: “Se pa ankò akoz sa ou te di yo ke nou kwè. Nou te tande pou kont nou e konnen ke Sila a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat 1:21</ref></char></note>Sovè a mond lan.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:40">Jn 4:40</ref></char></note>de jou Li te kite la, pou ale nan Galilée. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Paske Jésus Li menm te bay temwayaj ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref></char></note>yon pwofèt pa gen lonè nan pwòp peyi li. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Konsa, lè Li rive nan Galilée, Galileyen yo te resevwa Li, paske yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char></note>te wè tout bagay ke Li te fè nan Jérusalem pandan fèt la, pwiske yo tout te ale nan fèt la.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Li te vini ankò nan vil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1">Jn 2:1</ref></char></note>Cana nan Galilée, kote Li te fè dlo tounen diven an. Te genyen yon ofisye wayal la, epi fis li te malad nan Capernaüm. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Lè Li te tande ke Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:3-54">Jn 4:3-54</ref></char></note>te sòti Judée pou L antre nan Galilée, li te ale kote L e te mande L pou desann avèk li pou geri fis li a, paske li te prèt pou mouri.<verse eid="JHN 4:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Anmwenske nou wè </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:2">Dan 4:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sign ak mirak, nou p ap menm kwè.” </char><verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Ofisye wayal la te di Li: “Mesye, vini avan pitit mwen an mouri.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Jésus te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:13">Mat 8:13</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Ou mèt ale. Pitit ou ap viv.”</char> Mesye a te kwè Jésus epi te sòti.<verse eid="JHN 4:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Pandan li t ap desann, esklav li yo te rankontre li pou di li ke pitit la te vivan.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Li te mande yo kilè pitit la te kòmanse refè, e yo te di li: “Ayè sou setyèm lè lafyèv la te kite li.”<verse eid="JHN 4:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Konsa papa li te konnen ke se te nan menm lè sa ke Jésus te di li: “Pitit ou a ap viv.” E li menm te kwè, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:14">Trav 11:14</ref></char></note>tout lakay li ansanm avèk li.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Sa se te ankò dezyèm sign ke Jésus te fè lè Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:45">Jn 4:45</ref></char></note>kite Judée pou L antre nan Galilée.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:1">Det 16:1</ref></char></note>yon fèt Jwif, e Jésus te monte a Jérusalem.<verse eid="JHN 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>La nan Jérusalem toupre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:1-32">Né 3:1-32</ref></char></note> pòtay mouton an, gen yon basen dlo ke yo rele Béthesda, ki te gen senk galeri kouvri. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Nan sa yo te kouche sa yo ki te malad, avèg, oswa paralize ki t ap tann mouvman dlo a. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Paske yon zanj Senyè a te konn vini nan sèten sezon, epi antre nan basen an, epi vire dlo a. Konsa, sila ki te antre nan dlo a an premye lè dlo a vire te vin geri de nenpòt maladi ke li te genyen.<verse eid="JHN 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Alò yon sèten mesye ki te gen yon maladi depi trant-uit ane te la.<verse eid="JHN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Lè Jésus te wè l kouche la, epi te konnen ke li te konsa depi anpil tan, Li te di l <char style="wj">“Èske ou ta renmen geri?” </char><verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Mesye malad la te reponn Li: “Mesye, mwen pa gen moun pou mete m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:4">Jn 5:4</ref></char></note>nan dlo a lè l vire, men lè m ap vini, yon lòt gen tan mache desann avan m.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Jésus te di l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:6">Mat 9:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Leve, pran kabann ou, epi mache!” </char><verse eid="JHN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Imedyatman, nonm nan te geri, te pran kabann li, epi te kòmanse mache. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:14">Jn 9:14</ref></char></note>Jou sa a se te jou Saba.<verse eid="JHN 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Pou sa Jwif yo t ap di Li “Se jou Saba a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Né 13:19</ref></char></note>Li pa pèmi pou ou pote kabann ou konsa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Men li te reponn yo: “Li menm ki te geri m nan, se Li menm ki di m <char style="wj">‘Pran kabann ou mache.’”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Yo te mande li: “Ki moun sa ki te di ou <char style="wj">‘Pran kabann ou mache a?’</char><verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Men li menm ki te geri pa t konnen ki moun Li te ye, paske Jésus te chape ale pandan yo te gen yon foul sou plas.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Apre, Jésus te twouve li nan tanp lan, e te di l: <char style="wj">“Gade, ou gen tan geri.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:5">Mc 2:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Pa peche ankò pou anyen pi mal pa vin tonbe sou ou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Nonm nan te ale e te di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19">Jn 1:19</ref></char></note>Jwif yo ke se te Jésus ki te geri li.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Alò pou rezon sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19">Jn 1:19</ref></char></note>Jwif yo t ap pèsekite Jésus, paske Li t ap fè bagay sa yo nan Saba a.<verse eid="JHN 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Men Li te reponn yo e te di: <char style="wj">“Papa M ap travay jis koulye a, e Mwen menm ap travay tou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Men pou rezon sa, Jwif yo t ap chache plis pou yo ta kab touye L, paske non sèlman Li t ap vyole Saba a, men osi Li t ap rele Bondye Papa Li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:33">Jn 10:33</ref></char></note>ki te fè Li vin egal avèk Bondye.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Pou sa, Jésus te reponn e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Fis la pa kapab fè anyen pou kont Li, sof ke se yon bagay ke Li wè Papa a ap fè. Paske sa ke Papa a fè, Fis la ap fè yo menm jan an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Paske Papa a renmen Fis la, epi montre Li tout bagay ke Li menm ap fè. Epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:12">Jn 14:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pi gwo travay pase sa, Li va montre Li, pou nou etone.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/><char style="wj">Paske menm jan an ke Papa a leve mò yo pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Wo 4:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bay yo lavi, menm jan an</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:25">Jn 11:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Fis la osi bay lavi a sa ke Li vle.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske menm Papa a pa jije pèsòn, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:27">Jn 5:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li te bay tout jijman a Fis la,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/><char style="wj">Pou tout moun kapab bay onè a Fis la, menm jan ke yo onore Papa a.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luc 10:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Moun ki pa onore Fis la, pa onore Papa a ki te voye Li a.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, Anverite, Mwen di nou, moun ki tande pawòl Mwen, epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:44">Jn 12:44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kwè Li menm ki te voye Mwen an, genyen lavi etènèl, epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:18">Jn 3:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa p vini nan jijman, men li gen tan kite lanmò, pou antre nan lavi.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, Anverite Mwen di nou ke lè ap vini e koulye a gen tan rive, lè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:24">Luc 15:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mò yo tande vwa a Fis Bondye a. Epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:60">Jn 6:60</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sa yo ki tande ap viv. </char><verse eid="JHN 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske menm jan ke Papa a gen lavi nan Li menm, menm jan an</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li te bay Fis la osi pou gen lavi nan Li menm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/><char style="wj">Li te bay Li otorite pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:39">Jn 9:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">egzekite jijman, paske Li menm se Fis a Lòm nan. </char><verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pa fè sezisman pou sa, paske yon lè ap vini lè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:24">Jn 11:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tout moun sa yo ki nan tonbo yo ap tande vwa Li, </char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/><char style="wj">epi ap vin parèt.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sa yo ki te fè sa ki bon ap resisite a lavi, e sa yo ki te fè sa ki mal ap resisite pou jijman.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen pa kapab fè anyen pou kont Mwen. Sa ke Mwen tande, Mwen jije; epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:16">Jn 8:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jijman Mwen jis, paske Mwen pa chache volonte pa M, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:34">Jn 4:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">volonte a Li menm, ki te voye Mwen an.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:14">Jn 8:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si Mwen sèl fè temwayaj a Mwen menm, temwayaj la p ap vrè.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/><char style="wj">Gen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:37">Jn 5:37</ref></char></note><char style="wj">yon lòt moun ki pote temwayaj Mwen, epi M konnen ke temwayaj ke Li pote sou Mwen menm nan vrè.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ou te voye kote Jean, epi Li </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:7-32">Jn 1:7-32</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">te bay temwayaj a verite a. </char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/><char style="wj">Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:32">Jn 5:32</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">temwayaj ke Mwen resevwa a pa sòti nan lòm, men Mwen di nou bagay sa yo pou nou kapab sove.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Li menm li te lanp ki t a brile a, ki te limen pou klere, epi nou te</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:5">Mc 1:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">rejwi pou yon tan nan limyè pa l la. </char><verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men temwayaj ke Mwen genyen an pi gwo ke temwayaj Jean an. Paske </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:25-38">Jn 10:25-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">zèv ke Papa a te ban M pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:34">Jn 4:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">acheve yo, menm zèv ke Mwen fè yo, temwaye de Mwen menm, ke Papa a te voye M.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/><char style="wj">E Papa a ki te voye M nan,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li pote temwayaj de Mwen. Nou menm pa janm tande vwa Li nan okenn tan, ni nou pa janm wè fòm Li.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“E nou pa gen </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 2:14">I Jn 2:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">pawòl Li nan nou, pwiske nou pa kwè Sila ke Li te voye a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:52">Jn 7:52</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nou chache tout Ekriti Sen yo paske nou kwè ke nan yo menm nou gen lavi etènèl. E se yo menm ki temwaye de Mwen menm.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Malgre, nou pa dakò pou vin kote M pou nou ta kapab gen lavi. </char><verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:44">Jn 5:44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen pa resevwa glwa ki sòti nan lòm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/><char style="wj">Men Mwen konnen nou, ke nou pa genyen lamou Bondye nan nou menm.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen te vini nan non Papa M, e nou pa resevwa M. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:43">
    <char style="wj">“Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:5">Mat 24:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">si yon lòt vini nan pwòp non pa l, li menm nou va resevwa l.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/><char style="wj">Kijan nou kapab kwè lè nou resevwa glwa ki sòti nan youn anvè lòt, e nou pa chache </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Wo 2:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">glwa a ki sòti sèlman nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:3">Jn 17:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sèl Bondye ki genyen an.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pa panse ke Mwen va akize nou devan Papa a. Sila a k ap akize nou an se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:28">Jn 9:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Moïse, nan kilès nou gen tan mete espwa nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske si nou te kwè Moïse, nou t ap kwè Mwen, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luc 24:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">li te ekri selon Mwen menm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/><char style="wj">Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:29-31">Luc 16:29-31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">si nou pa kwè sa ke li te ekri, kijan nou va kwè pawòl pa Mwen yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref></char></note>Jésus te ale lòtbò Lamè Galilée a (oubyen Tibériade).<verse eid="JHN 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>E yon gran foul te swiv Li paske yo te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11-23">Jn 2:11-23</ref></char></note>sign ke Li t ap fè sou sa ki te malad yo.<verse eid="JHN 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:1">Mat 5:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te monte sou mòn nan, epi la Li te chita avèk disip Li yo.<verse eid="JHN 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Alò, Pak Jwif la t ap pwoche.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Jésus te leve zye Li, e lè L wè yon gran foul ki t ap pwoche Li, te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:43">Jn 1:43</ref></char></note>Philippe: <char style="wj">“Kibò n ap achte pen pou sila yo kapab manje.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Li t ap di L sa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:5">II Kor 13:5</ref></char></note>sonde l. Paske Li menm te konnen deja kisa Li te gen lentansyon pou fè.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Philippe te reponn Li: “Fòs pen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:37">Mc 6:37</ref></char></note>desan denye frè jounalye pou desan jou pa t ap sifi pou chak moun twouve menm yon ti mòso.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Youn nan disip yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:40">Jn 1:40</ref></char></note>André, frè a Simon Pierre te di L: <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Gen yon jènjan isit la ki gen senk pen fèt avèk lòj avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:11">Jn 6:11</ref></char></note>de pwason, men kisa sa ye pou tout fòs kantite moun sa yo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Fè moun yo chita.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:10">Te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:39">Mc 6:39</ref></char></note>anpil zèb nan plas sa a. Epi anviwon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:21">Mat 14:21</ref></char></note>senk-mil moun te chita.<verse eid="JHN 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Konsa, Jésus te pran pen yo epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:36">Mat 15:36</ref></char></note>aprè Li te bay Bondye remèsiman, Li te pataje l a tout sa yo ki te chita la. Menm jan tou avèk pwason yo. Tout kantite ke yo te vle.<verse eid="JHN 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Lè yo te plen, Li te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:2">Jn 2:2</ref></char></note>disip Li yo, <char style="wj">“Ranmase tout mòso ki rete yo pou anyen pa pèdi.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Konsa yo te ranmase yo, e yo te plen douz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:20">Mat 14:20</ref></char></note>panyen yo avèk ti mòso fèt pa senk pen lòj ke sa ki t ap manje yo te kite.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>E pou sa, lè moun yo te wè sign ke Li te fè a, yo te di: “Anverite sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:3">Mat 11:3</ref></char></note>Pwofèt ki gen pou vini nan lemonn nan.”<verse eid="JHN 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Lè Jésus apèsi ke yo gen lentansyon pou te vin pran L pa lafòs pou fè L wa, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref></char></note>retire kò Li ankò, epi ale nan mòn nan pou kont Li.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Alò, lè aswè vini, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:2">Jn 2:2</ref></char></note>disip Li yo te ale bò kote lamè a. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Yo antre nan yon kannòt, epi yo te travèse lamè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:45">Mc 6:45</ref></char></note>vè Capernaüm.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:17">Li te fènwa deja, e Jésus poko te vin kote yo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Lamè a te kòmanse boulvèse akoz yon gwo van ki t ap soufle.<verse eid="JHN 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Akoz sa, lè yo ta p naje ak zaviwon, a senk o sis kilomèt distans, yo te wè Jésus t ap vin vè kannòt la, tou mache sou dlo a. E yo te pè.<verse eid="JHN 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Men Li te di yo: “Se Mwen menm. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:27">Mat 14:27</ref></char></note>Pa pè.”<verse eid="JHN 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Konsa, yo te dakò pou resevwa L nan kannòt la. Epi imedyatman, kannòt la rive atè, kote yo t ap ale a.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Jou apre a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:2">Jn 6:2</ref></char></note>foul la ki te lòtbò lamè a te wè ke pa t gen lòt ti kannòt sof ke youn, epi ke Jésus pa t antre nan kannòt la avèk disip Li yo, men ke yo te kite la pou kont yo. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Te gen lòt ti kannòt ki te sòti Tibériade toupre plas kote yo te manje pen an apre Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:11">Jn 6:11</ref></char></note>te bay remèsiman an. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Konsa, lè foul la te wè ke Jésus pa t la, ni disip Li yo, yo menm te antre nan ti kannòt yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:34">Mat 14:34</ref></char></note>vini a Capernaüm pou chache Jésus.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>E lè yo te twouve Li lòtbò lamè a, yo te di L: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:7">Mat 23:7</ref></char></note>“Rabbi, kilè ou rive la a?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Jésus te reponn yo e te di: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite Mwen di nou, nou pa chache M paske nou te wè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:2-14">Jn 6:2-14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sign yo, men paske nou te manje pen, epi te plen.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:2">És 55:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:33">Jn 3:33</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Pa travay pou manje k ap peri, men pou manje k ap dire jiska lavi etènèl, ke Fis a Lòm nan va bay nou. Pwiske sou Li, Papa a, Bondye menm, gen tan mete so Li.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>E pou sa moun foul la te di Li: “Ki zèv nou kapab fè pou nou menm kapab fè zèv a Bondye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Jésus te reponn e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Sa se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">I Tes 1:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">zèv a Bondye, ke nou ta kwè nan Sila ke Li voye a.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Pou sa yo te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref></char></note>“Kisa konsa ou fè kon sign, pou nou kapab wè epi kwè ou? Ki zèv ou fè?” <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>“Papa zansèt nou yo te manje lamàn nan dezè a. Kon li ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:24">Sòm 78:24</ref></char></note>‘Li te bay yo pen ki sòti nan syèl la pou yo manje.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, se pa Moïse ki te bay nou pen ki sòti nan syèl la, men se Papa M ki bay nou vrè pen ki sòti nan syèl la.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/><char style="wj">Paske pen Bondye a se sila ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:41-50">Jn 6:41-50</ref></char></note><char style="wj">desann, sòti nan syèl la, e bay lavi a lemonn lan.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Pou sa yo te di L: “Senyè, toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:15">Jn 4:15</ref></char></note>bay nou pen sa a”.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:48">Jn 6:48</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mwen menm se pen lavi a. Moun ki vini kote Mwen p ap grangou, e sila ki kwè nan Mwen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:14">Jn 4:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">p ap janm swaf.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:26">Jn 6:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Mwen di nou ke nou wè M, e malgre, nou pa kwè. </char><verse eid="JHN 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:39">Jn 6:39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Tout sa ke Papa a ban Mwen yo ap vin kote Mwen, e sila a ki vin kote Mwen, Mwen p ap janm jete yo deyò. </char><verse eid="JHN 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:13">Jn 3:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pa t desann kite syèl la pou fè </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pwòp volonte pa M, men volonte a Li menm ki te voye M nan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/><char style="wj">E sa se volonte a Li menm ki te voye M nan, ke nan tout sa ke Li bay Mwen yo, Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:12">Jn 17:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa pèdi anyen, men fè li leve nan dènye jou a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/><char style="wj">Paske sa se volonte a Papa M, ke tout moun ki wè Fis la epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kwè nan Li kapab gen lavi etènèl. Epi Mwen menm va</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè l leve nan dènye jou a.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Pou sa, Jwif yo t ap mimire paske Li te di: <char style="wj">“Mwen menm se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:33-58">Jn 6:33-58</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pen ki desann soti nan syèl la.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>E yo t ap di: “Se pa Jésus sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:22">Luc 4:22</ref></char></note>fis a Joseph la? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:27">Jn 7:27</ref></char></note>Èske nou pa konnen ni manman L, ni papa L? Kijan Li di nou koulye a: ‘Mwen sòti nan syèl la’?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Jésus te reponn yo e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Pa mimire pami nou menm. </char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/><char style="wj">Pèsòn pa kapab vini a Mwen menm sof ke Papa a ki te voye M nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:3">Jr 31:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">atire li, epi Mwen menm va fè l leve nan dènye jou a.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Li ekri nan pwofèt yo:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">És 54:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘E yo tout va enstwi pa Bondye.’ Tout sa yo ki te tande epi enstwi pa Papa a, ap vini a Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Pa gen moun ki konn wè Papa a, sof ke sèl Sila a ki sòti nan Bondye a. Li konn wè Papa a.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, sila ki kwè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Jn 3:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">gen lavi etènèl.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:35-51">Jn 6:35-51</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen se pen lavi a. </char><verse eid="JHN 6:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>
    <char style="wj">“Papa zansèt nou yo te manje lamàn nan dezè a, e yo te mouri.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila a se pen ki sòti desann nan syèl la. Pou moun kab manje l epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Jn 3:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa mouri. </char><verse eid="JHN 6:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen menm se pen vivan ki desann sòti nan syèl la. Si nenpòt moun manje pen sa a, l ap viv jis pou jamen. E pen osi ke M ap bay </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:29">Jn 1:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">pou lavi lemonn nan se chè Mwen.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Pou sa Jwif yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:16">Jn 9:16</ref></char></note>kòmanse diskite youn avèk lòt e te di: “Kijan moun sa kapab bay nou chè Li pou manje?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite Mwen di nou, anmwenske nou manje chè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:20">Mat 8:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Fis a Lòm nan, epi bwè san Li, nou pa gen lavi nan nou menm.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moun ki manje chè M, epi bwè san Mwen, genyen lavi etènèl, epi M ap</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Jn 6:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè l leve nan dènye jou a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/><char style="wj">Paske chè M se vrè manje a, e san Mwen se vrè bwason an.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moun ki manje chè M epi bwè san Mwen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:4">Jn 15:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">rete avè M, epi Mwen menm avèk li. </char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/><char style="wj">Kon Papa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vivan an te voye M nan, e Mwen viv akoz Papa a, konsa, moun ki manje M, li menm osi va viv akoz Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sa se pen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Jn 3:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ki desann sòti nan syèl la. Se pa kon papa zansèt yo te manje a, e te mouri. Sila a ki manje pen sila a va viv jis pou janmen.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Bagay sa yo Li te di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>nan Sinagòg la pandan Li t ap ansegne nan Capernaüm nan.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Konsa, anpil nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:2">Jn 2:2</ref></char></note>disip Li yo lè yo te tande sa te di: “Pawòl sa a tèlman difisil. Ki moun ki ka tande sa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Men Jésus, byen konprann ke yo t ap plenyen konsa, te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske sa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:6">Mat 11:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè nou kilbite tonbe?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/><char style="wj">Kisa li ta ye konsa si nou ta wè Fis a Lòm nan k ap </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:13">Jn 3:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">monte kote Li te ye oparavan an?</char><verse eid="JHN 6:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:63 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 3:6">II Kor 3:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Se Lespri a ki bay lavi. Chè a pa gen okenn benefis. Pawòl ke Mwen te pale a nou yo se Lespri, epi se lavi.</char><verse eid="JHN 6:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men gen nan nou ki pa kwè.” </char> Pwiske Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:25">Jn 2:25</ref></char></note>te konnen depi nan kòmansman kilès nan yo ki pa t kwè, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:4">Mat 10:4</ref></char></note>kilès li te ye ki t ap trayi li a. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>E Li t ap di: <char style="wj">“Pou rezon sa a Mwen te di nou ke pèsòn pa kapab vin kote Mwen, sof ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:11">Mat 13:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">se Papa a ki pèmèt sa.” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Akoz sa a, anpil nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:66 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:2">Jn 2:2</ref></char></note>disip Li yo te retire kò yo, e pa t ap mache avèk Li ankò.<verse eid="JHN 6:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2">Mat 10:2</ref></char></note>douz yo: <char style="wj">“Epi nou menm pa vle ale tou?” </char><verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simon Pierre te reponn Li: “Senyè, a kibo nou ta ale? Ou gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:63">Jn 6:63</ref></char></note>pawòl lavi etènèl yo. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Nou te kwè, epi te vin konnen ke Ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mc 1:24</ref></char></note> Li Menm ki Kris la, Fis a Bondye vivan an.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:70 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16-19">Jn 15:16-19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Èske se pa Mwen menm ki te chwazi nou, douz la, epi youn nan nou se yon dyab?” </char> <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Konsa Li t ap refere a Judas Iscariot, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:71 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:4">Jn 12:4</ref></char></note> fis a Simon an, paske li menm, youn nan douz yo, t ap vin trayi Li.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:3">Jn 4:3</ref></char></note>t ap mache nan Galilée. Li pa t dakò pou mache nan Judée pwiske Jwif yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:18">Jn 5:18</ref></char></note>t ap chache pou touye L.<verse eid="JHN 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Koulye a, fèt a Jwif yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref></char></note>Fèt Tonèl yo, t ap pwoche. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:46">Mat 12:46</ref></char></note>Frè Li yo te di L: “Kite isit la epi ale nan Judée pou disip pa W yo osi kapab wè zèv ke Ou ap fè yo. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Paske pèsòn pa fè anyen nan sekrè lè li vle rekonèt an piblik. Si Ou fè bagay sa yo, Ou bezwen montre Ou menm a tout monn lan.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Paske menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:46">Mat 12:46</ref></char></note>frè Li yo pa t kwè nan Li.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:18">Mat 26:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lè M poko rive, men lè pa nou toujou bon.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:18">Jn 15:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Lemonn pa kapab rayi nou. Men Li rayi Mwen, paske Mwen temwaye sou li ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:19">Jn 3:19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">zèv li yo mechan.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monte nan fèt la nou menm. Mwen pa ale nan fèt sila a, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:6">Jn 7:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lè Mwen poko fin acheve.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Lè L fin di yo bagay sa yo, Li te rete nan Galilée.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:46">Mat 12:46</ref></char></note>frè Li yo te ale nan fèt la, alò, Li menm tou te monte. Pa an piblik, men kòmsi an sekrè.<verse eid="JHN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Konsa, Jwif yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:56">Jn 11:56</ref></char></note>t ap chache pou Li nan fèt la e t ap di: “Kote Li ye?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Epi te gen anpil pale pami foul la ki t ap fèt sou Li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:40-43">Jn 7:40-43</ref></char></note>Kèk t ap di: “Li se yon bon moun.” Lòt t ap di: “Non, okontrè l ap egare moun yo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Malgre sa, pèsòn pa t pale ovètman konsènan Li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:22">Jn 9:22</ref></char></note>yo te pè Jwif yo.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Men se lè yo te rive nan mitan fèt la ke Jésus te monte nan tanp lan, e te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:55">Mat 26:55</ref></char></note>ansegne.<verse eid="JHN 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19">Jn 1:19</ref></char></note>Jwif yo te etone, e t ap di “Kijan nonm sa a vin edike konsa, konsi Li pa te janm enstwi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Pou sa, Jésus te reponn yo e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:11">Jn 3:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lenstriksyon pa M se pa pa M, men se pou Li menm ki te voye M nan.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:9-14">Sòm 25:9-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si nenpòt moun dakò pou fè volonte L, l ap konnen enstriksyon an, si Li sòti nan Bondye, oubyen si Mwen pale pou kont Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/><char style="wj">Sila ki pale pou kont li </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:41">Jn 5:41</ref></char></note><char style="wj">chache pwòp glwa pa li, men Sila k ap chache glwa a Sila ki te voye L la; Li menm se verite, e pa gen linikite nan Li.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:17">Jn 1:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Èske Moïse pa t bay nou lalwa, men malgre sa, pa gen nan nou ki swiv lalwa? Poukisa nou ap</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:18">Mc 11:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">chache touye M?” </char><verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Foul la te reponn Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:8">Mat 11:8</ref></char></note>“Ou gen yon move lespri! Kilès k ap chache touye W la?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Jésus te reponn yo e te di: <char style="wj">“Mwen te fè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:2-16">Jn 5:2-16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">yon sèl zèv, e nou tout etone.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sou kont sila a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Moïse te bay nou sikonsizyon (pa paske li te soti nan Moïse, men nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:1">Jen 17:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">papa zansèt yo), e nan Saba a, nou sikonsize yon moun. </char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:2">Mat 12:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Si yon moun resevwa sikonsizyon nan Saba a, pou anpeche lalwa Moïse la vyole, èske nou fache avè M akoz ke Mwen te fè yon moun geri nèt nan Saba a.</char><verse eid="JHN 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jije selon aparans, men jije avèk jijman ki jis.” </char><verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Pou sa, kèk nan pèp Jérusalem la t ap di: “Se pa mesye sila a ke y ap chache touye a? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Epi gade, L ap pale devan tout moun, e yo p ap di L anyen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:13">Luc 23:13</ref></char></note>Otorite yo pa petèt sipoze konnen ke sa se Kris La? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:42">Jn 6:42</ref></char></note>nou menm konnen kote mesye sa a sòti. Men nenpòt lè Kris La vini, pèsòn p ap konnen kote Li sòti.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Akoz sa a, Jésus te rele fò nan tanp lan e te enstwi e te di: <char style="wj">“Nou non sèlman konnen Mwen e kote Mwen sòti. </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:42">Jn 8:42</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pa t vini pou kont Mwen, men Li menm ki te voye M nan vrè. Li menm ke nou pa konnen an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/><char style="wj">Mwen konnen Li paske Mwen </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:46">Jn 6:46</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">sòti nan Li, e </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jn 3:17</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Li te voye M.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>E yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:46">Mat 21:46</ref></char></note>t ap chache pou sezi Li, men pèsòn pa t mete men sou Li, paske lè Li poko te rive.<verse eid="JHN 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char></note>anpil nan foul la te kwè nan Li, e t ap di: “Lè Kris la vini, èske nou sipoze l ap fè plis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11">Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>sign pase sa mesye sila a gen tan fè yo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Farizyen yo te tande foul la ki t ap repete bagay sa yo konsènan Li. Epi chèf prèt yo avèk Farizyen yo te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:58">Mat 26:58</ref></char></note>ofisye yo pou sezi Li.<verse eid="JHN 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:35">Jn 12:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Pou yon ti tan anplis, Mwen avèk nou. Apre, M ap prale a Li menm ki te voye M nan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:36">Jn 7:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nou va chache M, e nou p ap twouve M. E kote Mwen ye, nou p ap kab vini.” </char><verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Pou sa Jwif yo te di youn ak lòt: “Kote mesye sa a prale pou nou p ap kab twouve L? Ou pa sipoze ke L ap prale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:2">Sòm 147:2</ref></char></note>nan dyaspora pami Grèk yo, pou l enstwi Grèk yo? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Kisa li t ap di la a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Nou va chache M, e nou p ap twouve M;</char> epi <char style="wj">Kote Mwen ye, nou p ap kab vini’?” </char><verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref></char></note>dènye jou fèt la, Jésus te kanpe e te kriye: <char style="wj">“Si nenpòt moun swaf, kite L vin kote Mwen epi bwè! </char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><char style="wj">Sila ki kwè nan Mwen, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:3">És 44:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tankou Ekriti Sen an di: ‘Sòti nan pi fon anndan l va fè koule rivyè dlo vivan yo.’” </char> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Men sa, Li te pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28">Jl 2:28</ref></char></note>konsènan Lespri a, ke sa ki te kwè nan Li yo ta resevwa. Paske Lespri a poko te parèt, akoz Jésus poko te vini nan glwa Li.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Kèk nan moun yo, lè yo te tande pawòl sa yo, t ap di: “Vrèman, sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:11">Mat 21:11</ref></char></note>pwofèt la.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Lòt t ap di: “Sa se Kris la”. Men toujou lòt t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:46">Jn 1:46</ref></char></note>“Asireman nou pa ta kwè Kris la ta pral sòti nan Galilée! <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Èske Ekriti Sen an pa konn di ke Kris la va sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:4">Sòm 89:4</ref></char></note>nan ras David, epi nan Bethléem, vil kote David te ye a?”<verse eid="JHN 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Konsa, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:16">Jn 9:16</ref></char></note>divizyon nan foul la akoz Li. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:30">Jn 7:30</ref></char></note>Kèk te vle sezi Li, men pèsòn pa t mete men l sou Li.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:32">Jn 7:32</ref></char></note>ofisye yo te vin kote chèf prèt ak Farizyen yo e te di yo: “Poukisa nou pa t mennen Li?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Ofisye yo te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref></char></note>“Janmen yon moun pa pale tankou moun sa a pale.”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Pou sa, Farizyen yo te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:12">Jn 7:12</ref></char></note>“Èske Li gen tan egare nou menm tou? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Èske gen pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:13">Luc 23:13</ref></char></note>gwo chèf Farizyen yo ki kwè nan Li? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Men foul sa a ki pa konnen Lalwa, gen madichon.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nicodème (ki te vin kote Li avan an, epi te youn nan yo) te di yo: <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:1">Egz 23:1</ref></char></note>“Lalwa pa nou pa jije yon moun avan ke premyèman li tande li epi konnen ki sa li fè. Èske sa konn fèt?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Yo te reponn li e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:46">Jn 1:46</ref></char></note>“Èske ou menm sòti nan Galilée tou? Egzaminen Lekriti yo epi ou va wè ke nanpwen pwofèt ki sòti nan Galilée.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>E tout moun ale lakay yo.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Men Jésus te ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:1">Mat 21:1</ref></char></note>Mòn Oliv la. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Gran maten a Li te vini ankò nan tanp lan, e tout pèp la t ap vin kote Li. E <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:55">Mat 26:55</ref></char></note>Li te chita, pou kòmanse enstwi yo. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Skrib yo ak Farizyen yo te mennen yon fanm ki te kenbe nan adiltè e te fè l chita nan mitan yo.<verse eid="JHN 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Yo te di Li: “Mèt, fanm sa te kenbe nan adiltè, nan zak la menm. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Epi nan Lalwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref></char></note>Moïse la, li te kòmande nou pou nou te lapide yon fanm konsa ak wòch. Kisa ou menm di?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Yo t ap di sa pou yo ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mat 16:1</ref></char></note>sonde l pou yo ta twouve mwayen pou akize Li. Men Jésus te bese, e te ekri atè a avèk dwat Li.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Men lè yo te pèsiste avèk demann sa a, Li te leve dwat epi te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">Det 17:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sila a ki pa gen peche pami nou, kite l se premye moun pou voye yon wòch sou li.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Ankò Li te bese e te kòmanse ekri atè a.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Lè yo tande sa, yo te kòmanse kite kote a youn pa youn. Sa te kòmanse avèk pi granmoun pami yo. Konsa, yo te kite Li la pou kont Li avèk fanm nan ki te rete menm kote li te ye a nan mitan lakou a. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Jésus te leve, e te di li: <char style="wj">“Fanm, kote yo ye? Nanpwen youn ki kondane ou?” </char> <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Li te di: “Pa youn, Senyè.” Jésus te di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jn 3:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ni Mwen menm, mwen pa kondane ou nonplis. Ale, epi depi koulye a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:14">Jn 5:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa peche ankò.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Ankò Jésus te pale avèk yo e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mwen se limyè a lemonn. Sila a ki swiv Mwen p ap mache nan tenèb, men l ap gen limyè lavi a.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Pou sa, Farizyen yo te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jn 5:31</ref></char></note>“Ou fè temwayaj pwòp tèt ou. Konsa temwayaj Ou pa vrè.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Jésus te reponn e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Menmsi Mwen pote pwòp temwayaj pa M, temwayaj Mwen vrè, paske Mwen konnen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:28">Jn 8:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kote Mwen sòti, e kote M ap prale, men nou pa konnen kote Mwen sòti, ni kote M ap prale.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nou menm nou jije pa lachè, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jn 3:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen p ap jije pèsòn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/><char style="wj">Men menmsi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:30">Jn 5:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen jije, jijman Mwen vrè, paske Mwen pa sèl, men Mwen avèk Li menm ki te voye M nan.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Menm nan </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Det 17:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">lalwa pa w la Li te ekri ke temwayaj a de moun vrè.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/><char style="wj">Mwen se Sila ki pote temwayaj pou pwòp tèt Mwen menm, e anplis,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:37">Jn 5:37</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a ki te voye M nan pote temwayaj sou Mwen.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Pou sa yo te di Li: “Kote Papa ou?” Jésus te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Nou pa konnen ni Mwen, ni Papa M. Si nou te</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:28">Jn 7:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">konnen Mwen, nou ta konnen Papa M tou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Pawòl sa yo Li te pale nan trezò a, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:14">Jn 7:14</ref></char></note>Li t ap enstwi nan tanp lan. Men pèsòn pa t sezi Li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:30">Jn 7:30</ref></char></note>lè Li poko te rive.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Li te di yo ankò: <char style="wj">“M ap prale, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou va chache M, e va mouri nan peche nou. Kote M ap prale, nou p ap kab vini.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Pou sa, Jwif yo t ap di: “Asireman Li p ap vin touye tèt Li. Konsi l ap di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:35">Jn 7:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Kote m ap prale, nou p ap kab vini?’” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Li t ap di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:31">Jn 3:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Nou sòti pa anba, men Mwen sòti pa anwo. Nou a lemonn sila a;</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:14-16">Jn 17:14-16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pa a lemonn sila a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/><char style="wj">Pou sa, Mwen te di nou ke nou tout va mouri nan peche nou yo. Paske anmwenske nou kwè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:5">Mat 24:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ke Mwen menm se Sila a, nou va mouri nan peche nou yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Epi yo t ap di Li: “Ki moun Ou ye?” Epi Jésus te di yo <char style="wj">“Menm sa a Mwen t ap di nou depi kòmansman. </char> <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/><char style="wj">Mwen gen anpil bagay pou pale e pou jije konsènan nou. </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:33">Jn 3:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sinon, Li menm ki te voye M nan vrè. E bagay ke M te tande de Li yo, sa yo Mwen pale a lemonn.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Yo pa t konprann ke Li t ap pale avèk yo konsènan Papa a.<verse eid="JHN 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Lè nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">leve Fis a Lòm nan, nou va konnen ke Mwen menm se Li menm, e ke M pa fè anyen pou kont Mwen, men Mwen pale bagay sa yo tankou Papa a te enstwi Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/><char style="wj">E Li ki te voye M nan avèk Mwen.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:16">Jn 8:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li pa t kite M pou kont Mwen, paske Mwen toujou fè bagay ki fè L kontan.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Pandan Li t ap pale, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:31">Jn 7:31</ref></char></note>anpil moun te vin kwè nan Li.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Konsa, Jésus t ap pale avèk Jwif yo ki te kwè nan Li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:7">Jn 15:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Si nou kontinye nan Pawòl Mwen, anverite, nou se disip Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/><char style="wj">E nou va konnen laverite a, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:36">Jn 8:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">verite a va fè nou lib.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Yo te reponn Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref></char></note>“Nou se pitit Abraham. Nou pa t janm esklav a pèsòn. Kijan ou kapab di <char style="wj">‘nou va vin lib?’” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Jésus te reponn yo <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:16">Wo 6:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tout moun ki fè peche se esklav a peche a.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Epi esklav la pa p toujou rete nan kay la, men </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:31">Luc 15:31</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Fis la ap toujou la.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/><char style="wj">Se pou sa, si Fis la </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:32">Jn 8:32</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">fè nou lib, nou ap vrèman lib.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen konnen ke nou se pitit </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Abraham, men nou ap chache touye M, paske pawòl Mwen pa gen plas nan nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/><char style="wj">Mwen pale bagay ke M gen tan wè avèk Papa M. E nou menm tou fè bagay ke nou te tande de</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:41-44">Jn 8:41-44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">papa pa nou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Yo te reponn Li e te di: “Abraham se Papa nou”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jésus te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Wo 9:7</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">“Si nou se pitit Abraham, fè zèv Abraham yo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/><char style="wj">Men jan li ye a, nou ap chache pou touye M, yon nonm ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:26">Jn 8:26</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">di nou laverite ke M te tande depi nan Bondye.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:40">
    <char style="wj">“Sila a, Abraham pa t janm fè.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/><char style="wj">Nou ap fè pwòp zèv papa nou.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Yo te di Li: “Nou pa t fèt kon pitit deyò. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:6">Det 32:6</ref></char></note>Nou gen yon sèl papa, Bondye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Si Bondye te Papa nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:1">I Jn 5:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou ta renmen M, paske Mwen sòti nan Li, e se nan Li ke M vini. Mwen pa vini pou kont Mwen, men se Li ki voye M.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Poukisa nou pa konprann sa ke M ap di a? Se paske nou pa kapab </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:25">Jn 5:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">tande pawòl Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 3:8">I Jn 3:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nou se pitit a papa nou, dyab la. Epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:17">Jn 7:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou vle fè volonte a papa nou. Li te yon asasen depi nan kòmansman, e li pa kanpe nan verite a, paske nanpwen verite nan li. Lè li manti, li manti pou kont li, paske se yon mantè li ye, epi papa a tout manti.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men akoz ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Jn 18:37</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pale laverite, nou pa kwè M.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/><char style="wj">Kilès nan nou ki gen prèv ke M peche? Si Mwen pale laverite, poukisa nou pa kwè M?</char><verse eid="JHN 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:6">I Jn 4:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki se pou Bondye, tande pawòl a Bondye. Men nou pa tande, paske nou pa pou Bondye.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Jwif yo te reponn e te di Li: “Èske nou pa di vrèman ke Ou se yon Samariten epi ke Ou gen yon move lespri?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Jésus te reponn: <char style="wj">“Mwen pa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:20">Jn 7:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">gen yon move lespri. Men Mwen onore Papa M, e nou dezonore M.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/><char style="wj">Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:41">Jn 5:41</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pa chache glwa pa M. Men gen youn ki chache, epi ki jije.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite Mwen di nou, si nenpòt moun kenbe pawòl Mwen, li p ap janm</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:28">Mat 16:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">wè lanmò.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Jwif yo te di Li: “Koulye a nou konnen ke Ou gen yon move lespri. Abraham te mouri, e pwofèt yo osi. Men Ou di: <char style="wj">‘Si nenpòt moun </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:55">Jn 8:55</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">kenbe pawòl Mwen, li p ap janm wè lanmò.’ </char> <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Anverite Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:12">Jn 4:12</ref></char></note>pa pi gran pase Papa zansèt nou, Abraham ki te mouri an? Pwofèt yo te mouri tou. Ki moun menm Ou fè pretansyon ke Ou ye?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Si Mwen bay glwa a Mwen menm, glwa sa a pa anyen.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:39">Jn 7:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Se Papa M ki fè M resevwa glwa. De kilès ke ou di M: ‘Li se Bondye Nou.’</char><verse eid="JHN 8:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nou poko vin rekonèt Li,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:29">Jn 7:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">men Mwen menm, mwen konnen Li. Si Mwen di ke M pa konnen L, Mwen ta yon mantè tankou nou menm, men Mwen vrèman konnen Li, e kenbe pawòl Li</char>.<verse eid="JHN 8:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>
    <char style="wj">“Papa zansèt nou, Abraham</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:17">Mat 13:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">te rejwi pou wè jou sa a, e Li te wè l, e te ranpli avèk jwa.” </char><verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:57 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:19">Jn 1:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou sa, Jwif yo te di L: “Ou poko gen senkant ane, e Ou te gen tan wè Abraham?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Jésus te di yo <char style="wj">“Anverite, avan Abraham te la,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:14">Egz 3:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen se.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Konsa, yo pran wòch pou lapide Li, men Li te kache kò Li, e te kite tanp la.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Pandan Li t ap pase, Li te wè yon nonm ki te avèg depi nesans Li.<verse eid="JHN 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Konsa, disip Li yo te mande: “Rabbi, kilès ki te peche. Mesye sa, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Egz 20:5</ref></char></note>paran li yo pou li ta fèt avèg?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Jésus te reponn: <char style="wj">“Se pa mesye sila, ni paran li yo. Men se te </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:4">Jn 11:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou zèv a Bondye ta kapab parèt nan Li.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/><char style="wj">Fòk nou fè zèv a Li menm ki te voye M nan </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:33">Jn 7:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pandan li fè jou. Lannwit lan ap vini lè pèsòn p ap kab travay.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/><char style="wj">Pandan Mwen nan lemonn, Mwen se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">limyè lemonn.” </char><verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Lè L di sa, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:33">Mc 7:33</ref></char></note>krache atè, e te fè ajil avèk krache a, e te mete l sou zye li. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>Li te di l: <char style="wj">“Ale lave nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:15">Né 3:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">basen Siloé a” </char>(ki te vle di “Ranvoye”).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:7">Epi konsa, li te ale lave, e lè l tounen, li te wè.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Vwazen yo ak sa yo ki te konn wè l lè l te konn mande charite, t ap di, “Se pa li menm ki te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:2-10">Trav 3:2-10</ref></char></note>chita mande a?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Lòt t ap di: “Se li menm”, men lòt toujou te di “Non, men li byen sanble li”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Li menm t ap di toujou, “Mwen menm se li”.<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Pou sa yo te di li: “Ebyen, kijan zye ou te louvri?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Li te reponn yo: “Nonm nan yo rele Jésus a te fè labou epi te fè yon onksyon pou zye m, epi Li di mwen: ‘Ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:7">Jn 9:7</ref></char></note>Siloé a epi lave’. Konsa, Mwen te ale lave, epi mwen te wè.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Yo te mande li: “Kote Li?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Li te reponn yo: “Mwen pa konnen”.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Yo te mennen sila a ki te avèg la devan Farizyen yo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jn 5:9</ref></char></note>Alò, se te nan jou Saba ke Jésus te fè ajil la e te louvri zye li.<verse eid="JHN 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 9:10">Jn 9:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ankò konsa, Farizyen yo t ap mande li kijan li te vin wè, epi li te di yo: “Li aplike ajil sou zye m, e mwen te lave, e mwen wè”.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Pou sa, kèk nan Farizyen yo t ap di: “Nonm sa a pa sòti nan Bondye, paske Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:2">Mat 12:2</ref></char></note>pa kenbe Saba a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Men lòt t ap di: “Kijan yon mesye ki se yon pechè kapab fè tout mirak sa yo?” Epi te gen yon divizyon pami yo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Ankò, yo te di a moun avèg la: “Kisa ou di pou Li, konsi se Li menm ki ouvri zye ou yo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Li te di: “Li se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18:15</ref></char></note>pwofèt.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:19">Jn 1:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jwif yo pa t kwè ke li te avèg pou l te vin wè, jis lè yo rele paran a sila a ki te resevwa vizyon li. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Yo te kesyone yo konsa e te mande: “Èske sa se pitit ou, ke ou di te fèt avèg la? Ebyen, kijan li wè koulye a?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Paran li te reponn yo epi te di: “Nou konnen ke sa se pitit nou, e ke li te fèt avèg. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Men kijan li wè koulye a, nou pa konnen. Mande li. Li rive sou laj li. Li ka pale pou kont li.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Paran li te pale konsa paske yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:13">Jn 7:13</ref></char></note>krent Jwif yo. Pwiske Jwif yo te deja dakò ke si nenpòt moun te konfese L kon Kris la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:22">Luc 6:22</ref></char></note>yo ta mete l deyò nan sinagòg la. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Pou rezon sa a, paran li yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:21">Jn 9:21</ref></char></note>“Li rive sou laj li. Mande li.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Konsa yon dezyèm fwa yo te rele nonm nan ki te avèg la, epi te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:19">Jos 7:19</ref></char></note>“Bay glwa a Bondye, nou konnen ke mesye sa a se yon pechè.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Pou sa, li reponn yo: “Si L se yon pechè, mwen pa konnen, men yon bagay mwen konnen. Ke m te avèg, e koulye a mwen wè.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Yo te mande l konsa: “Kisa Li te fè ou? Kijan Li te ouvri zye ou?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Li te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:15">Jn 9:15</ref></char></note>“Mwen te di nou sa deja, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:43">Jn 8:43</ref></char></note>nou pa t koute m. Poukisa nou vle tande sa ankò? Èske nou vle vin disip Li yo tou?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Konsa, yo te joure li e te di: “Ou se disip Li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:45">Jn 5:45</ref></char></note>nou se disip a Moïse. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Nou konnen ke Bondye te pale a Moïse, men pou mesye sila a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:14">Jn 8:14</ref></char></note>nou pa konnen kote Li sòti.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Mesye a te reponn yo e te di: “Men yon choz byen etonan. Ke nou pa konnen kote Li sòti, men Li te ouvri zye mwen. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:8">Job 27:8</ref></char></note>Bondye pa tande pechè yo, men si nenpòt moun gen lakrent Bondye, e fè volonte L, l ap koute li. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Depi kòmansman tan an, nou pa janm tande ke pèsòn ouvri zye a yon moun ki te fèt avèg. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:2">Jn 3:2</ref></char></note>Si moun sa a pa t sòti nan Bondye, Li pa t kab fè anyen.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Yo te reponn li e te di: “Ou te fèt nèt nan peche! Èske ou ap enstwi nou?” Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:22-35">Jn 9:22-35</ref></char></note>yo te mete l deyò.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Jésus te tande ke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:22-34">Jn 9:22-34</ref></char></note>mete l deyò. E Li te twouve li e te di: <char style="wj">“Èske ou kwè nan Fis a Lòm nan?” </char><verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Li te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:14">Wo 10:14</ref></char></note>“Se kilès Li ye, Senyè, pou m kab kwè nan Li?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Non sèlman ou konn wè L deja, men </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:26">Jn 4:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">se Li menm k ap pale avèk ou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Li di: “Senyè, mwen kwè!” E li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:2">Mc 8:2</ref></char></note>adore Li.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Jésus te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:22-27">Jn 5:22-27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Pou jijman Mwen te vini nan monn sila a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:18">Luc 4:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou sa yo ki pa wè kapab vin wè, e sa yo ki wè kapab vin avèg.” </char><verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Sila nan Farizyen yo ki te avèk Li te tande bagay sa yo e te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:19">Wo 2:19</ref></char></note>“Èske se nou menm ki avèg tou a?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:22-24">Jn 15:22-24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Si nou te avèg, nou pa t ap gen peche, men akoz ke nou di: ‘Nou wè’, peche nou la toujou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>
    <char style="wj">Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, sila ki pa antre nan pak mouton an pa pòt la, men monte pou l antre yon lòt jan, li menm se yon</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:8">Jn 10:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vòlè ak yon brigan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/><char style="wj">Men moun ki antre pa pòt la se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:11">Jn 10:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bèje mouton yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>
    <char style="wj">Pou li menm, gadyen pòt la va ouvri, epi mouton yo tande</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:4-16">Jn 10:4-16</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 10:27">27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vwa l. Li rele pwòp mouton li yo pa non yo, e mennen yo deyò.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/><char style="wj">Nenpòt lè L fè soti tout sa ki pou li yo, li ale devan yo, e mouton yo swiv li, paske yo rekonèt</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:5-16">Jn 10:5-16</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 10:27">27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vwa li.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/><char style="wj">Men yon etranje, yo p ap janm swiv li, men ap sove ale kite li, paske yo pa rekonèt </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:4-16">Jn 10:4-16</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">vwa etranje yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:25-29">Jn 16:25-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kalite pawòl sa a, Jésus te sèvi pou pale avèk yo, men yo pa t konprann bagay sa yo ke Li t ap di yo.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo ankò, <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, Mwen menm se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:1-9">Jn 10:1-9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pòt la pou mouton yo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/><char style="wj">Tout sa yo ki te vini avan M se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1">Jr 23:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vòlè ak brigan, men mouton yo pa t tande yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:1-9">Jn 10:1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen se pòt la. Si nenpòt moun antre pa Mwen, li va sove e va antre, sòti pou twouve patiraj.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Vòlè a vini sèlman pou l vòlè, touye, ak detwi. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:10">
    <char style="wj">“Mwen te vini pou yo</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:40">Jn 5:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ta kapab gen lavi, pou yo ta ka genyen l an abondans.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:11">És 40:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen menm se bon bèje a. Bon bèje a ap bay vi Li pou mouton yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila a ki se yon ouvriye jounalye epi pa yon</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:2">Jn 10:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bèje, ki pa mèt mouton yo, wè lou ap vini epi li kouri kite mouton yo. Lou a vin pran yo, epi gaye yo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/><char style="wj">Li sove ale, paske se yon ouvriye jounalye, e afè mouton pa konsène l.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen se bon bèje a.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:27">Jn 10:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen rekonèt sa yo ki pou Mwen, e pa Mwen yo rekonèt Mwen</char>. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/><char style="wj">Menm jan ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a rekonèt Mwen, Mwen rekonèt Papa a. Mwen bay vi Mwen pou mouton yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Epi Mwen gen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:8">És 56:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lòt mouton ki pa nan pak sa a. Fòk Mwen mennen yo tou. Epi yo va tande vwa M. Yo va vini yon sèl pak avèk yon bèje.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pou rezon sa a, Papa a renmen M, paske Mwen </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:11-18">Jn 10:11-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">bay lavi Mwen pou M kab reprann li ankò.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:53">Mat 26:53</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Okenn moun pa pran li nan men M, men Mwen bay li avèk pwòp volonte M. Mwen gen otorite pou bay li, e Mwen gen otorite pou reprann li ankò. Kòmandman sila a Mwen te resevwa l depi nan men Papa M.” </char><verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Konsa te leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:43">Jn 7:43</ref></char></note>yon divizyon pami Jwif yo akoz pawòl sa yo.<verse eid="JHN 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Anpil t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:20">Jn 7:20</ref></char></note>“Li gen yon dyab epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:21">Mc 3:21</ref></char></note>Li fou. Poukisa nou ap koute Li?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Lòt t ap di: “Pawòl sa yo se pa pawòl a yon move lespri. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:11">Egz 4:11</ref></char></note>Yon dyab p ap kab ouvri zye a yon moun ki avèg. Nou ta kwè sa?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Nan lè sa, Fèt Dedikasyon an t ap pase nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Se te nan tan livè, epi Jésus t ap mache nan tanp lan sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:11">Trav 3:11</ref></char></note>galeri Salomon an.<verse eid="JHN 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Pou sa, Jwif yo te rasanble antoure Li, epi t ap di Li: “Pou konbyen de tan W ap kenbe nou an sispann? Si ou menm se Kris la, fè nou konnen klè.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Mwen te di nou, e nou pa kwè M. Zèv ke M fè nan non Papa M yo, sa yo fè temwayaj de Mwen.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/><char style="wj">Men nou pa kwè, paske nou pa mouton Mwen yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mouton pa M yo</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:4-16">Jn 10:4-16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tande vwa M, e yo swiv Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/><char style="wj">E Mwen bay yo</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:2">Jn 17:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lavi etènèl, e yo p ap janm peri. E pèsòn p ap kab rachte yo nan men M.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Papa M ki te ban Mwen yo, pi gran pase tout moun. E pèsòn p ap kab rachte yo nan men a Papa a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:2">Jn 17:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen avèk Papa a se youn.” </char><verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Jwif yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:59">Jn 8:59</ref></char></note>leve pran wòch ankò pou lapide L.<verse eid="JHN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Mwen te montre nou anpil bon zèv ki te sòti nan Papa a. Pou kilès ladan yo n ap lapide M nan?” </char><verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Jwif yo te reponn: “Pou bon zèv, nou pa lapide Ou, men pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref></char></note>blasfèm nan. Paske Ou menm ki se yon nonm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:18">Jn 5:18</ref></char></note>pran poz ke se Bondye ou ye.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Èske li pa te ekri nan Lalwa pa w la ke: </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Sòm 82:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘Mwen di ke se dye yo nou ye’?</char><verse eid="JHN 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Si Li te rele yo dye yo, sila ki te resevwa pawòl Bondye yo (epi Ekriti Sen yo p ap kapab chanje),</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/><char style="wj">èske ou di a Li menm, Sila a ke Papa a te fè sen, epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jn 3:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">voye nan lemonn nan: ‘W ap blasfeme’ akoz Mwen di ke Mwen menm se Fis Bondye a?</char><verse eid="JHN 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:25">Jn 10:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si Mwen pa fè zèv a Papa M, pa kwè M.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/><char style="wj">Men si M fè yo, malgre ou pa kwè M, kwè zèv yo pou ou kapab konnen epi konprann ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:10-20">Jn 14:10-20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a nan Mwen, e Mwen nan Papa a.” </char><verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Pou sa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:20">Jn 7:20</ref></char></note>t ap chache ankò pou kenbe L, men Li te evite men yo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Li te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jn 1:28</ref></char></note>ankò lòtbò Jourdain an nan plas kote Jean te premye konn batize a. Li te demere la.<verse eid="JHN 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Anpil te vin kote L e t ap di: “Malgre Jean pa t fè yon sign, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:27-30">Jn 1:27-30</ref></char></note>tout bagay li te di selon mesye sa a se te vrè.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Anpil moun te kwè nan Li la.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Alò, yon sèten mesye te malad. Lazare a Béthanie, vilaj kote Marie ak sè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luc 10:38</ref></char></note>Marthe te rete a.<verse eid="JHN 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Se te sè Lazare, Marie ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:38">Luc 7:38</ref></char></note>onksyone Senyè a avèk lwil chè a, epi te siye pye Li avèk cheve li. Se frè li, Lazare, ki te malad. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Konsa, sè yo te voye kote Li pou di L: “Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:5-36">Jn 11:5-36</ref></char></note>sila ke ou renmen an malad.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Men lè Jésus te tande sa, Li te di: <char style="wj">“Maladi sa a se pa a lanmò,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:3">Jn 9:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">men pou glwa Bondye, pou Fis a Lòm nan kapab resevwa glwa de li.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Konsa, Jésus te renmen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jn 11:1</ref></char></note>Marthe ak sè li, ak Lazare. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Pou sa, lè L tande ke Li te malad, Li te rete de jou anplis nan plas kote Li te ye a. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Apre sa, Li te di a disip Li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:40">Jn 10:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Annou ale nan Judée ankò.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Disip Li yo te di Li: “Rabbi, fenk koulye a Jwif yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:59">Jn 8:59</ref></char></note>eseye lapide Ou, epi W ap prale la ankò?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:33">Luc 13:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Èske pa gen douz è de tan nan yon jounen? Si yon moun mache nan lajounen a li p ap chape tonbe, paske li wè limyè a mond sila a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/><char style="wj">Men si yon moun mache lannwit, l ap tonbe, paske limyè a pa nan li.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Sa, Li te di, epi apre sa, Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Zanmi nou Lazare</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:52">Mat 27:52</ref></char></note><char style="wj">gen tan tonbe nan dòmi. Men m ap prale pou M ka fè l leve nan dòmi.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Konsa, disip Li yo te di L: “Senyè, si li tonbe nan dòmi, l ap refè.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:24">Mat 9:24</ref></char></note>Jésus t ap pale de lanmò Li, men yo te konprann ke Li t ap pale de yon vrè dòmi.<verse eid="JHN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo byen klè: <char style="wj">“Lazare gen tan mouri,</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/><char style="wj">e pou koz pa nou, Mwen kontan ke M pa t la pou nou kapab kwè. Annou ale kote l.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Pou sa, Thomas, ke yo rele osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:24">Jn 20:24</ref></char></note>Didyme, te di disip parèy li yo: “Annou ale avèk Li pou nou kapab mouri avè L.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Konsa, lè Jésus te vini, Li te twouve ke Li te deja nan tonm nan depi kat jou. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jn 11:1</ref></char></note>Béthanie te prè Jérusalem. Anviwon twa kilomèt distans.<verse eid="JHN 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Anpil nan Jwif yo te deja vin kote Marthe ak Marie <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:11">Job 2:11</ref></char></note>pou konsole yo konsènan frè yo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Pou sa, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38-42">Luc 10:38-42</ref></char></note>Marthe te tande ke Jésus t ap vini, li te ale rankontre Li. Men Marie te toujou chita nan kay la.<verse eid="JHN 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Konsa, Marthe te di a Jésus: “Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:32-37">Jn 11:32-37</ref></char></note>si Ou te la, frè m nan pa t ap mouri. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Menm koulye a, mwen konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:31">Jn 9:31</ref></char></note>nenpòt bagay ke Ou mande Bondye, Bondye ap bay Ou li.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Frè ou ap leve ankò.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marthe te reponn Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note>“Mwen konnen ke li ap leve ankò nan rezirèksyon an nan dènye jou a.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Jésus te reponn Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mwen se rezirèksyon an ak lavi a. Moun ki kwè nan Mwen va viv, menm si li mouri.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/><char style="wj">E tout moun ki viv e kwè nan Mwen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:47-50">Jn 6:47-50</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:51">51</ref></char></note><char style="wj">p ap janm mouri. Èske ou kwè sa?” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Li te di Li: “Wi, Senyè, Mwen gen tan kwè ke Ou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref></char></note>Kris la, Fis a Bondye, menm Li menm ki vini nan mond lan.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Lè li te di sa, li te ale, e te rele Marie, sè li, e te di l apa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:18">Mat 26:18</ref></char></note>“Mèt la rive, e L ap mande pou ou.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>E lè li tande sa, li te leve vit, epi t ap vin kote Li. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Jésus poko te rive nan bouk la, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:20">Jn 11:20</ref></char></note>te toujou nan plas kote Marthe te rankontre Li a. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:19-33">Jn 11:19-33</ref></char></note>Jwif yo ki t ap konsole li nan kay la te wè l leve vit e sòti. Epi yo sipoze ke li t ap ale nan tonm nan pou kriye.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Konsa, lè Marie te vini kote Jésus, li te tonbe nan pye Li, e te di L: “Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:21">Jn 11:21</ref></char></note>si Ou te isit la, frè m nan pa t ap mouri.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Konsa, lè Jésus te wè l t ap kriye, epi Jwif ki te avè l yo t ap kriye, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:38">Jn 11:38</ref></char></note>te vrèman etone nan fon lespri Li, e te twouble. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Li te di: <char style="wj">“Kibò nou mete Li?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Yo te di Li: “Senyè, vin wè.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Jésus te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:41">Luc 19:41</ref></char></note>kriye.<verse eid="JHN 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>E Jwif yo t ap di: “Gade kijan Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:3-5">Jn 11:3-5</ref></char></note>te renmen l.” <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Men kèk nan yo te di: “Èske nonm sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:7">Jn 9:7</ref></char></note>ki te louvri zye a sa ki te avèg la, pa t kab anpeche moun sa a mouri osi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Pou sa, Jésus, ankò, etone byen fon nan lespri li, te vin bò kote tonm nan. Se te yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:60">Mat 27:60</ref></char></note>kav e yon wòch te apiye sou Li.<verse eid="JHN 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Retire wòch la.” </char> Marthe, sè mò a te di Li: “Senyè, pou lè sa, li va santi. Li la depi kat jou.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Jésus te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:4">Jn 11:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Èske Mwen pa t di ou ke si Ou kwè, ou va wè glwa Bondye?” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Epi konsa, yo te retire wòch la. Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:1">Jn 17:1</ref></char></note>te leve zye Li e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mat 11:25</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Papa, Mwen remèsye Ou ke Ou tande M.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/><char style="wj">Mwen te konnen ke Ou tande M tout tan, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:30">Jn 12:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">akoz pèp la ki kanpe antoure M, Mwen te di sa, pou yo kapab kwè ke Ou te voye Mwen.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Lè L fin te di bagay sa yo, Li te kriye avèk yon gwo vwa: <char style="wj">“Lazare, sòti deyò.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>E sila ki te mouri an te sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:40">Jn 19:40</ref></char></note>byen mare men ak pye yo avèk twal ki te vlope l, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:7">Jn 20:7</ref></char></note>yon twal ki te vlope figi li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Demare l epi lage l.” </char><verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Pou sa, anpil nan sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:19">Jn 11:19</ref></char></note>ki te vin kote Marie yo, e ki te wè sa Li te fè a, te kwè nan Li.<verse eid="JHN 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Men kèk nan yo te ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:32-45">Jn 7:32-45</ref></char></note>Farizyen yo e te di yo sa ke Jésus te fè a.<verse eid="JHN 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:32-45">Jn 7:32-45</ref></char></note>chèf prèt yo avèk Farizyen yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:3">Mat 26:3</ref></char></note>konvoke yon gran konsèy. Yo t ap di: “Kisa n ap fè, pwiske nonm sila a ap fè anpil sign.” <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>“Si nou kite Li kontinye konsa, tout moun ap kwè nan Li, epi Women yo ap vin pran ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref></char></note>plas nou, ni nasyon nou.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Men youn nan yo, Caïphe, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:51">Jn 11:51</ref></char></note>ki te granprèt pou lane sila a, te di yo: “Nou pa konnen anyen, <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>ni nou pa kontwole ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:14">Jn 18:14</ref></char></note>li ta meyè pou nou si yon moun ta mouri pou pèp la, pou tout nasyon an pa peri.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Alò li pa t di sa pou kont li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:13">Jn 18:13</ref></char></note>akoz ke li te wo prèt nan lane sa a, li t ap fè pwofesi ke Jésus t ap mouri pou nasyon an. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>E pa sèlman pou nasyon sila a, men ke Li ta kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:16">Jn 10:16</ref></char></note>ranmase ansanm pou fè yon sèl, tout pitit Bondye ki te gaye a letranje yo. <verse eid="JHN 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Depi jou sa, yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:4">Mat 26:4</ref></char></note>fè plan pou touye L.<verse eid="JHN 11:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Pou sa, Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:1">Jn 7:1</ref></char></note>pa t ankò mache an piblik pami Jwif yo, men te kite la pou ale nan peyi toupre dezè a, nan yon vil yo rele Éphraïm. Li te rete la avèk disip Li yo.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Alò, Pak Jwif la te pwòch, epi anpil te kite andwa andeyò yo pou monte nan Jérusalem, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:10">Nonb 9:10</ref></char></note>pou yo ta kab vin pirifye. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Konsa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:11">Jn 7:11</ref></char></note>t ap di youn ak lòt pandan yo kanpe nan tanp lan: “Kisa nou panse. Èske Li p ap menm vini nan fèt la?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:47">Jn 11:47</ref></char></note>chèf prèt yo ak Farizyen yo te bay lòd pou si nenpòt moun te konnen kote Li te ye, yo dwe bay rapò pou yo ta kab sezi L.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Pou sa a, sis jou avan fèt la Jésus te vini nan Béthanie, kote Lazare, moun Li te fè leve sòti nan lanmò a te ye a. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Konsa, yo te prepare yon manje pou li la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luc 10:38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Marthe t ap sèvi, men Lazare te youn nan yo ki te sou tab avèk Li. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Nan lè sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luc 7:37</ref></char></note>Marie te pran yon liv pafen yo rele nà ki te koute trè chè, e te vide sou pye a Jésus e te siye yo avèk cheve li. Kay la te ranpli avèk sant pafen sa a.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:71">Jn 6:71</ref></char></note>Judas Iscariot, youn nan disip Li yo, ki te gen lentansyon pou trayi Li, te di: <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Poukisa pafen sila a pa t vann pou twa san denye, pou yo ta bay malere yo?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Alò, li pa t di sa paske li te konsène pou malere yo, men paske se te yon vòlè li te ye. Epi konsi li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:29">Jn 13:29</ref></char></note>te responsab lajan nan bwat kès la, li te konn piyaje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:3">Luc 8:3</ref></char></note>sa ke yo mete ladann.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Pou rezon sa a, Jésus te di <char style="wj">“Pa deranje l, li te konsève sa a pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:40">Jn 19:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jou lantèman M. </char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Det 15:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Paske malere yo ap toujou avè w, men Mwen, ou p ap toujou genyen M.” </char><verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Konsa, gran foul Jwif yo te dekouvri ke Li te la, e yo te vini non sèlman akoz Jésus, men pou yo ta ka wè Lazare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:43">Jn 11:43</ref></char></note>ke Li te leve sòti nan lanmò a.<verse eid="JHN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Men chèf prèt yo te mete tèt yo ansanm pou yo ta kapab anplis mete Lazare a lanmò. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:45">Jn 11:45</ref></char></note>akoz li menm, anpil nan Jwif yo t ap kite e t ap kwè nan Jésus.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Nan jou aprè a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:4-9">Mat 21:4-9</ref></char></note>gran foul ki te vini nan fèt la, lè yo tande ke Jésus t ap vini nan Jérusalem, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>te pran branch pye palmis, e te ale rankontre Li, e te kòmanse kriye “Ozana, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sòm 118:26</ref></char></note>ozana, beni sila a ki vini nan non Senyè a, Wa Israël la.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Jésus te twouve yon jenn bourik e te chita sou li. Tankou li ekri, <verse eid="JHN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Za 9:9</ref></char></note>“Pa pè, O fi a Sion. Gade byen, Wa ou ap vini, byen chita sou yon jenn bourik.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Nan kòmansman, disip Li yo pa t konprann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:32">Mc 9:32</ref></char></note>bagay sa yo, men lè Jésus te resevwa glwa, Yo sonje ke yo te ekri sou Li e ke yo te fè L bagay sa yo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:42">Jn 11:42</ref></char></note>pèp la ki te avè L lè Li te rele Lazare deyò nan tonm nan, e te fè l leve sòti nan lanmò a, t ap toujou fè temwayaj de Li. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:37">Luc 19:37</ref></char></note>Pou koz sa, foul la te ale rankontre Li, paske yo te tande ke Li te fè sign sila a. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Akoz sa a, Farizyen yo te di youn ak lòt: “Nou wè ke nou p ap fè anyen ki bon. Gade, lemonn ap kouri dèyè Li.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Konsa, te gen sèten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:35">Jn 7:35</ref></char></note>Grèk pami yo ki t ap monte pou adore nan fèt la. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Yo te ale kote Philippe ki te sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:21">Mat 11:21</ref></char></note>Bethsaïda nan Galilée, e te kòmanse mande li: “Mesye, nou vle wè Jésus.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Philippe te vin di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:44">Jn 1:44</ref></char></note>André. E André ak Philippe te di Jésus sa.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Jésus te reponn yo e te di: <char style="wj">“Lè a rive pou Fis a Lòm nan kapab </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:39">Jn 7:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">resevwa glwa.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:9">Wo 14:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sof ke yon grenn ble tonbe nan tè epi mouri, li rete pou kont li, men si li mouri, l ap fè anpil fwi. </char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Moun ki renmen vi li va pèdi l, e moun ki rayi vi li nan mond sa a va konsève li jiska lavi etènèl. </char><verse eid="JHN 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Si nenpòt moun ap sèvi Mwen, fòk li swiv Mwen. E </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:3">Jn 14:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">kote Mwen ye, la sèvitè Mwen va ye tou. Si nenpòt moun ap sèvi Mwen, Papa a va onore li.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:38">Mat 26:38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Koulye a nanm Mwen vin twouble. Epi kisa M ap di: ‘Papa, sove M de lè sa a’? Men se pou rezon sa a ke M te rive nan lè sa a. </char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/><char style="wj">Papa, ke non Ou kapab resevwa glwa!” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref></char></note>vwa te sòti nan syèl la: “Mwen te non sèlman bay li glwa a, men Mwen va bay li glwa ankò.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Foul la ki te kanpe la epi te tande sa, te di ke yo tande loraj. Lòt yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:9">Trav 23:9</ref></char></note>“Yon zanj pale avèk Li.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Jésus te reponn e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:42">Jn 11:42</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Vwa sa a pa t vini pou kòz pa M, men pou kòz pa nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/><char style="wj">Koulye a jijman vini sou mond sa a. Koulye a</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:30">Jn 14:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mèt mond sa a va jete deyò.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/><char style="wj">E Mwen, si Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">gen tan leve wo anwo tè a, va </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:44">Jn 6:44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">atire tout moun kote Mwen menm.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Men Li te di sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:32">Jn 18:32</ref></char></note>pou montre ki kalite mò Li ta pral mouri an.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Pou sa, foul la te reponn Li: “Nou te tande nan Lalwa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sòm 110:4</ref></char></note>Kris la ap la jis pou jamen. E kijan ou kapab di: <char style="wj">‘Fis a Lòm nan oblije leve wo?’ </char>Kilès Fis a Lòm sila a?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Akoz sa, Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Pou yon ti tan anplis, limyè a pami nou. Mache pandan nou gen limyè a, pou tenèb la pa gen tan pran nou. Sila ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:6">I Jn 1:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mache nan tenèb la pa konnen kote l ap prale. </char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/><char style="wj">Pandan nou gen limyè a, kwè nan limyè a pou nou kapab vini fis a limyè a.” </char> Bagay sa yo Jésus te pale, epi Li ale kache kò Li pou yo pa jwenn Li.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Men malgre ke Li te fè tout sign sa yo devan yo, toujou yo pa t kwè nan Li. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Pou pawòl a pwofèt la, Ésaïe, ta kapab akonpli lè l te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">És 53:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Senyè, kilès ki kwè nan rapò nou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">E a kilès bra Letènèl la devwale?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Pou rezon sa, yo pa t kab kwè. Paske Ésaïe te di ankò: <verse eid="JHN 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">És 6:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">“Li te fè zye yo avegle, e te fè kè yo di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">sof ke yo wè avèk zye yo, apèsi avèk kè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">epi vin konvèti, epi Mwen ta geri yo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Bagay sa yo, Ésaïe te di paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">És 6:1</ref></char></note>li te wè glwa Li, e akoz ke li te wè glwa Li, li te pale sou Li.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Malgre sa, menm anpil nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:13">Luc 23:13</ref></char></note>gran chèf yo te kwè nan Li, men akoz Farizyen yo, yo pa t konfese sa a, akoz krent ke yo ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:22">Jn 9:22</ref></char></note>vin mete deyò nan sinagòg la. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:41-44">Jn 5:41-44</ref></char></note>Paske yo te gen lanvi pou lwanj a lòm olye lwanj Bondye.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Jésus te kriye e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sila a ki kwè nan Mwen, pa kwè nan Mwen, men nan Li menm ki te voye Mwen an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:9">Jn 14:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sila a ki wè M, wè Li menm ki te voye Mwen an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen te vini kon yon limyè nan mond lan, pou tout moun ki kwè nan Mwen pa rete nan tenèb.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Si nenpòt moun tande pawòl Mwen yo, e pa kenbe yo, Mwen pa jije li. Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jn 3:17</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pa t vini nan lemonn pou jije lemonn, men pou sove lemonn. </char><verse eid="JHN 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luc 10:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sila a ki rejte Mwen, epi pa resevwa pawòl Mwen yo, gen youn k ap jije li.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Det 18:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Pawòl ke Mwen te pale a se li k ap jije li nan dènye jou a.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske Mwen pa t pale pou kont Mwen, men Papa a, Li menm, ki te voye M</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:31">Jn 14:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">te kòmande Mwen kisa pou M pale, e kisa pou M di</char>. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/><char style="wj">E Mwen konnen ke </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kòmandman Li se lavi etènèl. Pou sa, se konsa Mwen pale; </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:19">Jn 5:19</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">menm sa ke Papa a di Mwen yo, konsa Mwen pale.” </char><verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Alò, avan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:55">Jn 11:55</ref></char></note>Fèt Pak Jwif la, Jésus te byen okouran ke lè Li te rive epi ke Li t ap kite mond sa a pou ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:3">Jn 13:3</ref></char></note>kote Papa a. Konsa Li te renmen moun pa Li yo ki te nan lemonn. Li te renmen yo jiska lafen.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Pandan yo t ap soupe, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:70">Jn 6:70</ref></char></note>dyab la te deja mete nan kè Judas, fis Simon an, pou trayi Li.<verse eid="JHN 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Jésus, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref></char></note>byen konnen ke Papa a te mete tout bagay nan men Li, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:42">Jn 8:42</ref></char></note>Li te sòti nan Bondye, e t ap retounen a Bondye, <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>te leve nan soupe a. Li te retire gwo vètman Li. Li te pran yon twal e te vlope l nan kò Li. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Li te vide dlo nan basen an e te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:4">Jen 18:4</ref></char></note>lave pye a disip Li yo, e siye yo avèk twal ki te vlope L la.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>E konsa, lè L rive nan Simon Pierre, li te di Li: “Senyè, w ap lave pye mwen?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Jésus te reponn e te di Li: <char style="wj">“Sa ke M ap fè la a koulye a, ou p ap konprann, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12">Jn 13:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pita, ou va konprann.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Pierre te di Li: “Ou p ap janm lave pye mwen!” Jésus te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:2">Sòm 51:2</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 51:7">7</ref></char></note>“Si Mwen pa lave ou, ou p ap gen pati nan Mwen.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simon Pierre te di Li: “Senyè, pa sèlman pye mwen, men anplis men mwen ak tèt mwen.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Sila a ki gen tan benyen sèlman bezwen lave pye li. Men tout rès li pwòp. </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:3">Jn 15:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nou menm nou pwòp, men pa tout pami nou.” </char> <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:64">Jn 6:64</ref></char></note>Li te konnen kilès ki t ap trayi Li, e pou rezon sa a Li te di: <char style="wj">“Se pa tout nan nou ki pwòp.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Konsa, lè Li te lave pye yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:4">Jn 13:4</ref></char></note>reprann vètman Li yo, Li te apiye sou tab la ankò, e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou konnen kisa Mwen gen tan fè nou la a?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/><char style="wj">Nou rele M ‘Mèt’, epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:2">Jn 11:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Senyè’, e nou gen rezon, paske se sa Mwen ye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/><char style="wj">Pou sa, si Mwen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:2">Jn 11:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Senyè a ak Mèt la lave pye nou, nou osi dwe lave pye youn a lòt.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/><char style="wj">Paske Mwen te bay nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">I Pi 5:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">yon egzanp ke nou menm osi dwe fè tankou Mwen te fè pou nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, yon </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">esklav pa pi gran pase mèt li. Ni yon moun ki voye pa pi gran pase sila ki voye l la.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/><char style="wj">Si nou konnen bagay sa yo, nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:24">Mat 7:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">beni si nou fè yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Se pa a nou tout ke M pale. Mwen konnen sila ke M te chwazi yo. Men se pou Lekriti sen yo kapab akonpli.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sòm 41:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">‘Sila ki manje pen Mwen an te leve talón li kont Mwen.’</char><verse eid="JHN 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Depi koulye a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:29">Jn 14:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap di nou avan li rive, pou lè li rive, nou kapab kwè ke </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:24">Jn 8:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen menm se Li.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sila a ki resevwa nenpòt moun ke M voye, resevwa M. E sila ki resevwa Mwen, resevwa Li menm ki te voye Mwen an.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Lè Jésus te fin di sa, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:33">Jn 11:33</ref></char></note>vin twouble nan lespri L, e te fè temwayaj e te di: <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite Mwen di nou ke youn nan nou ap trayi M.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Disip yo te kòmanse gade youn a lòt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:21">Mat 26:21</ref></char></note>san okenn lide sou kilès nan yo Li t ap pale a.<verse eid="JHN 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Te gen youn ki t ap apiye sou Jésus, sila ke Li te renmen anpil la.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:26">Jn 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Konsa, Simon Pierre te fè l siyal, e te di li: “Di nou kilès nan nou ke L ap pale a.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Sila ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:20">Jn 21:20</ref></char></note>apiye sou pwatrin Jésus e te di Li: “Senyè, kilès li ye?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Pou sa, Jésus te reponn: <char style="wj">“Sila a ke M ap bay mòso pen ke M pral tranpe bay li a.” </char> Lè L tranpe mòso a Li te pran li bay Judas, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:71">Jn 6:71</ref></char></note>fis a Simon Iscariot.<verse eid="JHN 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Epi apre mòso a, Satan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:3">Luc 22:3</ref></char></note>te antre nan li. Konsa, Jésus te di l: <char style="wj">“Sa w ap fè a, fè vit.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Pèsòn pami sa yo sou tab la pa t konnen pou ki rezon Li te di l sa. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Kèk te sipoze ke se te akoz Judas <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:6">Jn 12:6</ref></char></note>te gen bwat kès la, epi ke Jésus t ap di l: “Ale achte bagay nou bezwen pou fèt la,” oubyen petèt ke li ta dwe bay kèk choz a malere yo.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Apre li te resevwa mòso a, li te sòti nan menm moman an. E <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:53">Luc 22:53</ref></char></note>li te lannwit.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Konsa, lè l gen tan ale, Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Koulye a Fis a Lòm nan gen tan resevwa glwa, epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:13">Jn 14:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Bondye resevwa glwa nan Li.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/><char style="wj">Si Bondye resevwa glwa nan Li,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:1">Jn 17:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Bondye osi ap resevwa glwa Li, nan Li menm, epi va resevwa glwa Li koulye a menm.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pitit Mwen yo, Mwen avèk nou pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:33">Jn 7:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">yon ti tan anplis. </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nou ap chache M, e tankou Mwen te di Jwif yo, koulye a M ap di nou tou. Kote M ap ale, nou p ap kab vini.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yon kòmandman nèf Mwen bay nou. </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Ke nou renmen youn a lòt menm jan ke Mwen renmen nou. Konsa renmen youn a lòt.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:14">I Jn 3:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Konsa, tout moun ap konnen ke nou menm se disip Mwen yo, si nou gen lamou youn pou lòt.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simon Pierre te di Li: “Senyè, kibò W ap prale?” Jésus te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:33">Jn 13:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Kote M ap prale a, ou p ap kapab ale koulye a, men pita, ou va swiv Mwen.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Pierre te di Li: “Senyè, poukisa mwen pa kapab swiv Ou koulye a? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:33-35">Mat 26:33-35</ref></char></note>Mwen va bay vi m pou Ou.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Jésus te di: <char style="wj">“Èske ou va bay vi ou pou Mwen? Anverite, anverite, Mwen di ou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:30">Mc 14:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">avan kòk la gen tan chante, ou va rejte Mwen twa fwa.” </char><verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:27">Jn 14:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Pa kite kè nou twouble. Kwè nan Bondye, e kwè anplis nan Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nan kay Papa M gen anpil chanm. Si li pa t konsa, Mwen t ap di nou sa. Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:33-36">Jn 13:33-36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap prale pou prepare yon plas pou nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/><char style="wj">E si Mwen ale pou prepare yon plas pou nou, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:18-28">Jn 14:18-28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap vini ankò pou resevwa nou a Mwen menm, ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:26">Jn 12:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kote Mwen ye, nou kapab la tou. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/><char style="wj">E nou konnen chemen kote M ap prale a.” </char><verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:16">Jn 11:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Thomas te di Li: “Senyè, nou pa konnen kote W ap prale a. Kijan nou kapab konnen chemen an?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>
    <char style="wj">Jésus te di li: “Mwen se </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:9">Jn 10:9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">chemen, verite ak lavi a. Pèsòn p ap vini nan Papa a, sof ke pa Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:9">Jn 10:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Si nou te konnen Mwen, nou ta konnen Papa M tou. Depi koulye a, nou konnen Li, e wè Li.” </char><verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:43">Jn 1:43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Philippe te di Li: “Senyè, montre nou Papa a, epi l ap sifi pou nou.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Jésus te di Li: <char style="wj">“Èske Mwen gen tout tan sa a avèk nou, e ou poko vin rekonèt Mwen, Philippe? </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sila ki gen tan wè M, gen tan wè Papa a. Kijan ou di: ‘Montre m Papa a?’</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/><char style="wj">Èske ou pa kwè ke </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Mwen nan Papa a, e Papa a nan Mwen?</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:10">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:19">Jn 5:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Pawòl ke Mwen pale ou yo, Mwen pa pale pa volonte pa M, men Papa a, ki rete nan Mwen fè travay Li. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/><char style="wj">Kwè Mwen, ke </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:38">Jn 10:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen nan Papa a, e ke Papa a nan Mwen. Oubyen apa de sa,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:36">Jn 5:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kwè menm akoz zèv mwen yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, moun ki kwè nan Mwen, zèv ke Mwen fè yo, li menm va fè yo tou, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:20">Jn 5:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pi gwo zèv pase sa yo l ap fè. Paske Mwen ap ale kote Papa a.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Konsa,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mat 7:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nenpòt bagay ke nou mande nan non Mwen, M ap fè li pou Papa a kapab resevwa glwa nan Fis la. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/><char style="wj">Si nou mande M nenpòt bagay</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16">Jn 15:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nan non Mwen, M ap fè l.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:21-23">Jn 14:21-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si nou renmen M, nou va kenbe kòmandman Mwen yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Konsa, M ap mande Papa a, e Li va bay nou yon lòt </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:39">Jn 7:39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">konseye, pou Li kapab avèk nou jis pou janmen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/><char style="wj">Sa se </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:26">Jn 15:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Lespri verite a, ke lemonn nan pa kapab resevwa, paske li pa wè Li, ni konnen Li. Men nou konnen Li, paske Li rete avèk nou, epi Li va nan nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen p ap kite nou kon òfelen.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:3-28">Jn 14:3-28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap vin kote nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/><char style="wj">Apre yon ti tan, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:16-22">Jn 16:16-22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lemonn p ap wè M ankò. Men nou menm ap wè m.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:57">Jn 6:57</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Akoz ke Mwen viv, nou menm ap viv tou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/><char style="wj">Nan jou sa nou ap konnen ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:38">Jn 10:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen menm nan Papa a, e nou nan Mwen, e Mwen nan nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:15-23">Jn 14:15-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Moun ki gen kòmandman Mwen yo, e kenbe yo, se li ki renmen M. E li menm ki renmen M, ap renmen pa Papa Mwen, e Mwen va renmen l epi va devwale M a li.” </char><verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Judas, se pa Iscariot la, te di Li: “Senyè, kisa menm ki rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:40-41">Trav 10:40-41</ref></char></note> ki fè W ap devwale Ou a nou, e pa a lemonn?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Jésus te reponn e te di Li: <char style="wj">“Si nenpòt moun renmen M, li va</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:51">Jn 8:51</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">kenbe pawòl Mwen, e Papa M va renmen li, e Nou va vin kote li, epi va demere avèk li”. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/><char style="wj">Moun ki pa renmen M pa kenbe pawòl Mwen. E</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:16">Jn 7:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pawòl sa a ke nou tande a se pa pa M, men se sa ki nan Papa ki te voye M nan. </char><verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Bagay sa yo Mwen pale pandan Mwen rete avèk nou an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/><char style="wj">Men Konseye a, Espri Sen an, ke Papa a va voye nan non Mwen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:13">Jn 16:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Li va enstwi nou tout bagay, e fè nou sonje tout sa ke Mwen te di nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:33">Jn 16:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Lapè Mwen kite avèk nou. Lapè Mwen, Mwen bay nou. Pa kon lemonn konn bay, Mwen bay nou. Pa kite kè nou twouble, ni pa kite l krent. </char><verse eid="JHN 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nou te tande ke Mwen te di nou: ‘M ap prale, e Mwen va vin kote nou’. Si nou te renmen M nou ta rejwi, paske M ap prale kote Papa a. Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:29">Jn 10:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a pi gran pase M. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/><char style="wj">E koulye a</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:19">Jn 13:19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen gen tan di nou avan li rive, pou lè l rive, nou kapab kwè.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen p ap pale anpil anplis avèk nou, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Jn 12:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mèt a mond sa a ap vini, e li pa gen anyen nan Mwen. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/><char style="wj">Men pou lemonn kapab konnen ke Mwen renmen Papa a; jan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:18">Jn 10:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a kòmande M, konsa ojis, Mwen fè l. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">
    <char style="wj">“Leve, annou kite isit la.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Sòm 80:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen se vrè pye rezen an, epi se Papa M ki okipe pye rezen an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/><char style="wj">Chak branch nan Mwen ki pa pote fwi, Li retire. E chak branch ki pote fwi, li taye pou l pote plis fwi.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:10">Jn 13:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nou deja pwòp akoz pawòl ke Mwen te pale a nou an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:56">Jn 6:56</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Rete nan Mwen, e Mwen nan nou. Kon branch lan pa kapab pote fwi pou kont li, sof ke li rete nan pye rezen an, ni nou pa kapab, sof ke nou rete nan Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen se pye rezen an, nou se branch yo. Moun ki rete nan Mwen, e Mwen nan li, li</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16">Jn 15:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pote anpil fwi. Paske apa de Mwen, nou pa kapab fè anyen. </char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/><char style="wj">Si nenpòt moun pa rete nan Mwen, li</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:2">Jn 15:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">va jete kon yon branch, e l ap seche. Y ap ranmase yo e jete yo nan dife, epi y ap brile.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/><char style="wj">Si nou rete nan Mwen, e pawòl Mwen rete nan nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mat 7:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mande nenpòt sa nou vle, e l ap fèt pou nou. </char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/><char style="wj">Konsa,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:16">Mat 5:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa M ap resevwa glwa, lè nou pote anpil fwi. E konsa, nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:31">Jn 8:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè prèv ke nou se disip Mwen yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Menm jan ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:31">Jn 8:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a renmen M, Mwen renmen nou tou. Rete nan amou Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/><char style="wj">Si nou kenbe kòmandman Mwen yo, nou ap rete nan amou Mwen.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:29">Jn 8:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Menm jan ke Mwen te kenbe kòmandman a Papa M yo, e rete nan amou pa Li a. </char><verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bagay sa yo Mwen pale nou, pou jwa M kapab nan nou, e ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:29">Jn 3:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jwa nou kapab konplete.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/><char style="wj">Sa se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kòmandman Mwen, pou nou renmen youn a lòt, menm jan ke Mwen renmen nou an.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/><char style="wj">Pa gen pi gran amou pase sa. Ke yon moun </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:11">Jn 10:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bay vi li pou zanmi li yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nou se zanmi Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:50">Mat 12:50</ref></char></note><char style="wj">si nou fè sa ke Mwen kòmande nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/><char style="wj">Mwen p ap rele nou esklav ankò, paske yon esklav pa konnen kisa mèt li ap fè. Men Mwen rele nou zanmi, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:26">Jn 8:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tout bagay ke Mwen tande nan Papa M, Mwen fè nou konnen.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:70">Jn 6:70</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nou pa t chwazi Mwen, men Mwen te chwazi nou, e te etabli nou pou nou ta kapab pote fwi, e ke fwi sa a ta kapab dire, pou nenpòt sa ke nou mande Papa a, nan non pa M, Li kapab bay nou li.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sa Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kòmande nou, pou nou renmen youn a lòt.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:7">Jn 7:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si lemonn rayi nou, byen konnen ke li te rayi M avan nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/><char style="wj">Si nou te apatyen a lemonn, lemonn ta renmen pa li, men akoz ke nou pa apatyen a lemonn, e ke Mwen te chwazi rachte nou nan mond sa a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">akoz sa yo rayi nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sonje pawòl ke Mwen te di nou an: ‘Yon esklav pa pi gran pase mèt li’. Si yo te pèsekite Mwen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:12">I Kor 4:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">y ap pèsekite nou tou. Si yo te kenbe pawòl Mwen, yo va kenbe pawòl pa nou osi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/><char style="wj">Men tout bagay sa yo, yo va fè nou pou koz a Non pa M,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:19-55">Jn 8:19-55</ref></char></note><char style="wj">paske yo pa konnen Sila a ki te voye M nan.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 9:41">Jn 9:41</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si Mwen pa t vini pou pale avèk yo, yo pa t ap gen peche, men koulye a yo pa gen eskiz pou peche yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moun ki rayi M, rayi Papa M tou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:41">Jn 9:41</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Si Mwen pa t fè pami yo zèv ke okenn lòt pa t janm fè, yo pa t ap gen peche, men koulye a, yo wè, e yo rayi M, e Papa M tou.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men yo te fè sa pou pawòl la ta kapab akonpli ki te ekri nan Lalwa pa yo:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Sòm 35:19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Yo te rayi Mwen san koz.’</char><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Lè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Jn 14:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Konseye a vini, sila a ke M ap voye bay nou sòti nan Papa a, sa se Lespri verite a, ki sòti nan Papa a, L ap fè temwayaj de Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/><char style="wj">E </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:48">Luc 24:48</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou va fè temwayaj tou, paske nou te avèk Mwen depi nan kòmansman.” </char><verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen pale nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:18-27">Jn 15:18-27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bagay sa yo pou nou kapab evite chite.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yo va</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:22">Jn 9:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mete nou deyò nan sinagòg la, epi lè a ap vini ke y ap konprann ke se yon sèvis yo rann Bondye lè yo touye nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/><char style="wj">Bagay sa yo, yo va fè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:19-55">Jn 8:19-55</ref></char></note><char style="wj">paske yo pa t janm konnen Papa a, ni Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/><char style="wj">Men bagay sa yo Mwen te pale nou an</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:19">Jn 13:19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou lè lè a rive, nou va sonje ke M te di nou sa. Epi bagay sa yo Mwen pa t di nou nan kòmansman, paske Mwen te avèk nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men koulye a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:33">Jn 7:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap prale a Sila a ki te voye Mwen an. E pa gen nan nou k ap mande M: ‘Kibò W ap prale’?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/><char style="wj">Men akoz ke M te di nou bagay sa yo,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:1">Jn 14:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">gwo doulè antre nan kè nou.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men Mwen di nou laverite se nan lavantaj pa nou ke M ap prale. Paske si M pa ale,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Jn 14:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Konseye a p ap vin kote nou, men si M ale,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:26">Jn 14:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap voye Li bay nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/><char style="wj">E Li, lè L vini, L ap konvenk lemonn konsènan peche, ladwati, ak jijman.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/><char style="wj">Konsènan peche, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:22-24">Jn 15:22-24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">paske yo pa kwè nan Mwen,</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/><char style="wj">Selon</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:14">Trav 3:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ladwati, paske Mwen ale nan Papa a, e nou p ap ka wè M ankò.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Jn 12:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Epi selon jijman, paske Mèt mond sa a gen tan jije. </char><verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen gen anpil bagay anplis pou M ta di nou, men nou p ap kab sipòte yo koulye a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/><char style="wj">Men lè Li,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:7">Jn 14:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Lespri verite a vini, Li va</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:26">Jn 14:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">dirije nou nan tout verite. Paske Li p ap pale pou kont Li, men sa Li tande, L ap pale. Li va montre nou tout sa ki va vini.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/><char style="wj">Li va</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:39">Jn 7:39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè M resevwa glwa Mwen, paske l ap pran sa ki pou Mwen, e fè nou konprann li.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 17:10">Jn 17:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Tout bagay ke Papa a genyen se pou Mwen. Pou sa, Mwen di nou Li pran sa ki pou Mwen, e devwale li a nou. </char><verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yon ti tan, e </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:18-24">Jn 14:18-24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou p ap wè M ankò, epi yon ti tan anplis, e nou va wè M.” </char><verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Kèk nan disip Li yo te di youn a lòt: “Kisa L ap di nou la a? <char style="wj">‘Yon ti tan, e nou p ap wè M ankò, epi yon ti tan anplis e nou va wè M’</char> epi: <char style="wj">‘akoz ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:5">Jn 16:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">M ap prale nan Papa a’?” </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Konsa yo t ap di: “Kisa L ap pale: <char style="wj">‘Yon ti tan’</char>? Nou pa konprann kisa L ap di.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:32">Mc 9:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te konnen yo te vle kesyone L, epi Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou ap diskite pami nou sou sa ke M te di a: ‘Yon ti tan, e nou p ap wè M ankò, epi yon ti tan anplis, e nou va wè M?’ </char><verse eid="JHN 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou, ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:27">Luc 23:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou va kriye avèk lamantasyon, men lemonn va rejwi. Nou va ranpli avèk tristès, men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:20">Jn 20:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tristès la va vin chanje an jwa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:8">És 13:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Lè yon fanm gen doulè nesans, li gen tristès, paske lè li rive, men lè l fin bay nesans a pitit la, li pa sonje soufrans lan ankò, akoz jwa ke yon pitit gen tan fèt nan lemonn.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Konsa,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:6">Jn 16:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou menm tou gen tristès koulye a. Men</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:16">Jn 16:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen va wè nou ankò, e kè nou ap rejwi, e pèsòn p ap retire jwa nou ankò.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“E nan jou sa a</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:19-30">Jn 16:19-30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou p ap menm poze M kesyon sou okenn choz. Anverite, anverite, Mwen di nou,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16">Jn 15:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">si nou mande Papa a pou nenpòt bagay, L ap bay nou Li nan non Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:14">Jn 14:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Jis rive koulye a nou pa mande pou anyen nan non Mwen. Mande e nou va resevwa, pou jwa nou kapab vin ranpli.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bagay sa yo Mwen pale nou an</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:34">Mat 13:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">parabòl. Lè a ap vini lè M p ap pale avèk nou ankò an parabòl, men M ap pale nou byen klè konsènan Papa a.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nan jou sa a</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:19-30">Jn 16:19-30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nou va mande nan non Mwen, e Mwen p ap di nou ke M ap mande Papa a anfavè nou.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/><char style="wj">Paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:21-23">Jn 14:21-23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a Li menm, renmen nou paske nou renmen Mwen, e te kwè ke Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:42">Jn 8:42</ref></char></note><char style="wj">te sòti nan Papa a. </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/><char style="wj">Mwen te sòti nan Papa a, e te vini nan lemonn. M ap kite lemonn ankò e ap</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-3">Jn 13:1-3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">prale kote Papa a.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Disip Li yo te di: “Alò koulye a W ap pale klè. Ou p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:34">Mat 13:34</ref></char></note>sèvi ak parabòl. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Koulye a nou konnen ke Ou konnen tout bagay, e pa bezwen moun mande Ou anyen. Akoz sa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11">Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>kwè ke Ou soti nan Bondye.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Jésus te reponn yo: <char style="wj">“Èske nou kwè koulye a?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/><char style="wj">Veye byen, lè a ap vini, e gen tan vini deja,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Za 13:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou nou vin gaye, chak a pwòp kay li, e pou kite M sèl.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:29">Jn 8:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Men M p ap sèl, paske Papa a toujou avè M.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bagay sa yo Mwen pale nou, pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:27">Jn 14:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nan Mwen, nou kapab gen lapè. Nan lemonn nou gen tribilasyon, men pran kouraj.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:37">Wo 8:37</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen venk lemonn.” </char><verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Jésus te pale bagay sa yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:41">Jn 11:41</ref></char></note>ak zye Li leve pou gade vè syèl la, Li te di. <char style="wj">“Papa, lè a rive.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:31">Jn 13:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Bay glwa a pitit Ou, pou pitit Ou kapab bay a Ou menm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/><char style="wj">Menm jan ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ou te bay Li otorite sou tout chè, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:28">Jn 10:28</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">a tout sa ke Ou te bay Li yo, pou Li ta kapab bay lavi etènèl.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“E sa se lavi etènèl,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:44">Jn 5:44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou yo kapab konnen Ou, sèl vrè Dye a, ak Jésus Kri ke Ou voye a.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:31">Jn 13:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen te bay Ou glwa sou latè, lè M te</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:34">Jn 4:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">acheve travay ke Ou ban M fè a.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“E koulye a, ban M glwa ansanm avèk Ou Menm, Papa,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jn 1:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">avèk glwa ke M te gen avè W avan lemonn te egziste a.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen fè non Ou rekonèt a moun</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:37-39">Jn 6:37-39</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ke Ou te ban Mwen nan lemonn yo. Yo te pou Ou, e Ou te ban Mwen yo. Konsa, yo kenbe pawòl Ou. </char><verse eid="JHN 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Koulye a, yo gen tan konnen ke tout bagay ke Ou ban Mwen soti nan Ou menm.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/><char style="wj">Paske </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:49">Jn 12:49</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pawòl ke Ou te ban Mwen yo, Mwen bay yo, e yo te resevwa yo e te vrèman konprann ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:42">Jn 8:42</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen soti nan Ou menm. Yo te kwè ke Ou te voye Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:32">Luc 22:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen mande anfavè yo.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:20">Jn 17:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen pa mande pou lemonn, men pou sa ke Ou te ban Mwen yo. Paske se pou Ou yo ye. </char><verse eid="JHN 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:15">Jn 16:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Tout bagay ki pou Mwen, se pou Ou, e sa ki pou Ou, se pou Mwen. Mwen resevwa glwa nan yo.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen pa nan lemonn ankò. Malgre, yo menm, yo toujou nan lemonn, e Mwen vini a Ou, Papa ki Sen, kenbe yo nan non Ou, non </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:9">Fil 2:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">ke Ou ban Mwen an,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:2">Jn 17:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou yo kapab vin yon sèl, menm jan ke nou menm, nou se yon sèl. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/><char style="wj">Pandan Mwen te avèk yo, Mwen t ap kenbe yo nan non Ou, sa ke Ou te ban Mwen yo. E Mwen te gade yo. Youn nan yo pa t pèdi sof</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:70">Jn 6:70</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fis pèdisyon an, pou </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jn 13:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Lekriti ta kapab akonpli. </char><verse eid="JHN 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men koulye a, </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:33">Jn 7:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Mwen ap vini kote Ou. Konsa, </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:11">Jn 15:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">bagay sa yo Mwen pale nan lemonn pou yo kapab gen lajwa Mwen tou ranpli nèt nan yo menm.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen te bay yo pawòl Ou. E</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:19">Jn 15:19</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">lemonn rayi yo. Paske yo pa nan lemonn, menm jan ke Mwen pa nan lemonn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/><char style="wj">Mwen pa mande Ou pou retire yo nan lemonn, men pou kenbe yo kont</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:37">Mat 5:37</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sila ki mechan an. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:14">Jn 17:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Yo pa nan lemonn menm jan ke Mwen pa nan lemonn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:3">Jn 15:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Fè yo vin sen pa laverite. Pawòl Ou se laverite.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kon Ou te voye M nan lemonn nan, </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:5">Mat 10:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Mwen osi voye yo nan lemonn.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/><char style="wj">E pou koz a yo menm, Mwen vin sen Mwen menm, pou yo menm kapab</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:3">Jn 15:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vin sen nan laverite.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen pa mande pou sila yo sèlman, men pou sa yo osi ki kwè nan Mwen pa pawòl pa yo.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/><char style="wj">Pou yo tout kapab fè yon sèl.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:38">Jn 10:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Menm jan ke Ou menm, Papa, Ou nan Mwen, e Mwen nan Ou, pou yo kapab nan Nou tou. Pou lemonn kapab kwè ke Ou te voye M.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Glwa ke Ou ban Mwen an, Mwen bay yo. Pou yo kapab fè yon sèl, menm jan ke Nou fè yon sèl.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:38">Jn 10:38</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen nan yo, e Ou nan Mwen, pou yo kapab vin pafè nan linite, pou lemonn kapab konnen ke Ou te voye Mwen, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:27">Jn 16:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">te renmen yo, menm jan ke Ou renmen Mwen.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Papa, Mwen vle ke yo menm tou, ke Ou ban Mwen yo, kapab avèk Mwen kote Mwen ye a, pou yo kapab wè glwa M, ke Ou ban Mwen, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:34">Mat 25:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Ou te renmen Mwen avan fondasyon lemonn.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“O Papa </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 17:11">Jn 17:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">ladwati a, malgre lemonn pa konnen Ou, Mwen konnen Ou. E sa yo konnen ke Ou te voye Mwen.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/><char style="wj">E </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:6">Jn 17:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen te fè non Ou rekonèt a yo, e yo va fè l rekonèt; pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:9">Jn 15:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">menm lamou ke Ou renmen Mwen an, kapab nan yo, epi Mwen menm nan yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Lè Jésus te pale pawòl sa yo, Li te pase avèk disip Li yo lòtbò ravin Cédron an, kote te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:36">Mat 26:36</ref></char></note>jaden. Li menm te antre la avèk disip Li yo.<verse eid="JHN 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Anplis, Judas osi, ki t ap trayi Li a te konnen plas la, pwiske Jésus te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luc 21:37</ref></char></note>reyini la souvan ak disip Li yo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref></char></note>Judas, ki te deja resevwa kòwòt sòlda Women an avèk ofisye chèf prèt yo ak Farizyen yo, te vini la avèk lantèn, flanbo, ak zam.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Jésus, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:64">Jn 6:64</ref></char></note>byen okouran sou tout bagay ki t ap vini sou Li yo, te vin parèt epi te di yo: <char style="wj">“Kilès n ap chache?” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Yo te reponn Li: “Jésus, Nazareyen an.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Mwen menm se Li”. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judas osi ki t ap trayi Li a, te kanpe avèk yo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Lè konsa, Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Mwen menm se Li,” </char> yo te fè bak epi tonbe atè.<verse eid="JHN 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Ankò konsa, Li te mande yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:4">Jn 18:4</ref></char></note>“<char style="wj">Kilès n ap chache?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">E yo te di: “Jésus, Nazareyen an.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Jésus te reponn: <char style="wj">“Mwen te di nou ke Mwen menm se Li. Si se pou sa, se Mwen nou ap chache, lese lòt yo fè wout yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Pou pawòl ke Li te pale a ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:12">Jn 17:12</ref></char></note>akonpli: <char style="wj">“Nan sa ke Ou te ban Mwen yo, Mwen pa t pèdi youn.” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Konsa, Simon Pierre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:51">Mat 26:51</ref></char></note>ki te gen yon nepe, te rale li e te frape esklav wo prèt la, epi te koupe zòrèy dwat la. Esklav la te rele Malchus.<verse eid="JHN 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Konsa, Jésus te di Pierre: <char style="wj">“Mete nepe a nan fouwo a. </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:22">Mat 20:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Tas ke Papa a ban Mwen an, èske M pa pou bwè l?” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mat 26:57</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, kòwòt women an, avèk kòmandan, avèk ofisye Jwif yo te arete Jésus, e te mare Li. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Yo te mennen Li premyèman bò kote Anne. Paske Li menm te bòpè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:3">Mat 26:3</ref></char></note>Caïphe, ki te wo prèt nan lane sa a. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Epi se te Caïphe ki te bay konsèy a Jwif yo ke li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:50">Jn 11:50</ref></char></note>ta meyè pou yon moun mouri pou benefis a tout pèp la.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:58">Mat 26:58</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Simon Pierre t ap swiv Jésus ansanm ak yon lòt disip.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:15">Alò, disip sila a te rekonèt pa wo prèt la, e te antre avèk Jésus nan lakou wo prèt la, <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:69">Mat 26:69</ref></char></note>Men Pierre te kanpe prè pòt deyò a. Pou sa, lòt disip ki te byen rekonèt pa wo prèt la te ale deyò a e te pale avèk gadyen pòt la, epi te fè Pierre antre.<verse eid="JHN 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Fi domestik ki te okipe de pòt la te di Pierre: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:25">Jn 18:25</ref></char></note>“Èske Ou pa osi youn nan disip a mesye sila a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Li te di: “Se pa Mwen.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Epi lòt esklav yo ak ofisye ki te la yo, te fè yon dife avèk chabon, pwiske li te fè frèt e yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:54-67">Mc 14:54-67</ref></char></note>chofe kò yo. Pierre te la avèk yo tou, e te kanpe la pou chofe kò li.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Mat 26:59-68</ref></char></note>wo prèt la t ap kesyone Jésus konsènan disip Li yo, e sou sa Li te enstwi yo.<verse eid="JHN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Jésus te reponn Li: <char style="wj">“Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:26">Jn 7:26</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pale ouvètman a lemonn. Mwen te toujou enstwi nan sinagòg yo, ak nan tanp lan, kote tout Jwif yo rasanble. E Mwen pa t pale anyen an sekrè.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/><char style="wj">Poukisa nou ap kesyone M? Mande sa yo ki tande sa ke M te pale yo. Yo konnen sa ke M te di yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Lè Li te di sa, youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:3">Jn 18:3</ref></char></note>ofisye yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:3">Jn 19:3</ref></char></note>frape Jésus, e te di: “Èske se konsa Ou reponn wo prèt la?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:39">Mat 5:39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jésus te reponn li: <char style="wj">“Si Mwen pale mal, fè temwayaj a mal la, men si Mwen pale byen, poukisa Ou frape M?” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 18:3">Jn 18:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Akoz sa a, Anne te voye Li tou mare bay Caïphe, wo prèt la.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Simon Pierre te kanpe ap chofe kò li. Yo te di l konsa: “Se pa ou menm tou ki youn nan disip Li yo?” Li te demanti sa e te di: “Non, se pa Mwen.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Youn nan esklav wo prèt la, konsi, yon manm fanmi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:10">Jn 18:10</ref></char></note>sila a ki te gen zòrèy koupe pa Pierre a te di: “Èske M pa t wè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:1">Jn 18:1</ref></char></note>nan jaden an avèk Li?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Konsa, Pierre te demanti sa ankò, epi lapoula, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:38">Jn 13:38</ref></char></note>kòk la te chante.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:2">Mat 27:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te mennen Jésus soti kote Caïphe, pou antre nan Tribinal la. Li te trè bonè, e yo pa t antre nan tribinal la pou yo pa vin souye, pou yo toujou ta kapab manje Pak la.<verse eid="JHN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">Mat 27:11-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou sa, Pilate te soti deyò pou pale avèk yo e te di: “Ki akizasyon nou pote kont nonm sila a?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Yo te reponn e te di li: “Si nonm sila pa te yon malfektè, nou pa t ap livre li bay ou.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Epi Pilate te di yo: “Pran Li nou menm epi jije Li selon lalwa pa nou.” Jwif yo te di li: “Li pa pèmi pou nou mete yon moun a lanmò.”<verse eid="JHN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:19">Mat 20:19</ref></char></note>pawòl ke Jésus te pale a ta kapab akonpli, ki te montre ki kalite mò Li t ap mouri.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Konsa, Pilate te antre ankò nan Tribinal la, e te rele Jésus, e te di Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:3">Luc 23:3</ref></char></note>“Èske Ou se Wa a Jwif yo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Jésus te reponn li: <char style="wj">“Èske ou mande sa pou kont ou, oubyen èske gen lòt moun ki pale ou de Mwen?” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilate te reponn: “Èske mwen menm se yon Jwif? Pwòp nasyon pa W te livre Ou ban mwen. Kisa Ou fè?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Jésus te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:53">Mat 26:53</ref></char></note>“<char style="wj">Wayòm Mwen pa de mond sila a. Si wayòm Mwen te de mond sila a, sèvitè Mwen yo ta goumen pou Mwen pa ta livre a Jwif yo, men koulye a, wayòm Mwen pa de isit.” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pou sa, Pilate te di Li: “Alò se yon wa ke Ou ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:11">Mat 27:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Ou di byen kòrèk, ke se yon wa ke Mwen ye. Pou sa Mwen fèt, e Pou sa Mwen vini nan lemonn. Pou pote temwayaj a laverite. Tout moun ki nan laverite a tande vwa M.” </char><verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilate te di L: “Kisa ki laverite a?” Lè l fin di sa, li te ale deyò ankò kote Jwif yo, e te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:4">Luc 23:4</ref></char></note>“Mwen pa twouve okenn koupabilite nan mesye sila a. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref></char></note>Men nou gen yon koutim, ke Mwen gen pou lage pou nou yon moun nan lè Pak Jwif la. Èske konsa, nou ta renmen m lage pou nou Wa a Jwif Yo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Pou sa yo te kriye ankò e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:14">Trav 3:14</ref></char></note>“Pa mesye sila a, men lage Barabbas”. Alò, Barabbas te yon vòlè.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Konsa, Pilate te pran Jésus epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:26">Mat 27:26</ref></char></note>te bat Li ak fwèt. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:16-19">Mc 15:16-19</ref></char></note>Sòlda yo te trese yon kouwòn pikan e te mete li sou tèt Li. Yo te abiye Li ak yon gwo vètman mov. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Yo t ap repete pawòl: “Sali, Wa Jwif Yo!” epi t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">És 50:6</ref></char></note>bay Li kou nan figi li.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilate te parèt deyò ankò epi te di: “Gade byen, mwen mennen L devan nou ankò pou nou ka konnen ke m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:4">Luc 23:4</ref></char></note>pa twouve okenn koupabilite nan Li.”<verse eid="JHN 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Konsa Jésus te vin parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:2">Jn 19:2</ref></char></note>abiye avèk kouwòn pikan an ak gwo vètman mov la. Epi Pilate te di yo: “Gade nonm nan!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Konsa, lè chèf prèt yo ak ofisye yo te wè Li, yo te kriye fò e te di: “Krisifye! Krisifye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilate te di yo: “Pran Li nou menm epi krisifye Li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:4">Luc 23:4</ref></char></note>mwen pa twouve okenn koupabilite nan Li.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Jwif yo te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref></char></note>“Nou gen yon lwa, e pa lwa sila a, Li dwe mouri paske Li te fè kòmsi se Fis a Bondye Li ye.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Lè Pilate te tande pawòl sila a, li te vin krent plis. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Li te lantre ankò nan tribinal la e te di a Jésus: “Kote Ou soti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:63">Mat 26:63</ref></char></note>Jésus pa t reponn li.<verse eid="JHN 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pou sa, Pilate te di L: “Ou pa pale avè m? Èske Ou pa konnen ke m gen otorite pou krisifye Ou?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Jésus te reponn Li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:1">Wo 13:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ou pa t ap gen otorite sou Mwen si li pa t soti anwo. Konsa, sila a ki livre M bay ou a gen pi gwo peche.” </char><verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Akoz sa a, Pilate te fè yon efò pou lage Li, men Jwif yo te kriye fò epi te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:2">Luc 23:2</ref></char></note>“Si ou lage nonm sila a, ou pa zanmi a César. Nenpòt moun ki fè kòmsi se yon wa li ye, se lènmi a César.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Lè konsa, Pilate te tande pawòl sa yo, li te mennen Jésus deyò, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:19">Mat 27:19</ref></char></note>chita sou chèz jijman an nan plas yo rele Pave a, men an Ebre Gabbatha. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:62">Mat 27:62</ref></char></note>Jou Preparasyon pou Pak Jwif la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Li te anviwon sizyèm lè. Li te di a Jwif yo: “Men Wa nou!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Pou sa yo te kriye fò: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:18">Luc 23:18</ref></char></note>“Fè L soti, fè L soti, krisifye L!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilate te di yo: “Èske m ta krisifye Wa nou an?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Chèf prèt yo te reponn: “Nou pa gen okenn lòt wa ke César.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:26">Mat 27:26</ref></char></note>livre Li pou krisifye. Yo te pran Li, epi te mennen L ale.<verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:33-44">Mat 27:33-44</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Li te soti e t ap pote pwòp kwa Li vè plas ke yo rele Plas a Zo Tèt Mò a, ke nan lang Ebre yo rele Golgotha. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>La yo te krisifye Li, ansanm avèk de lòt mesye yo, youn nan chak kote avèk Jésus nan mitan.<verse eid="JHN 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilate te ekri yon enskripsyon, e te mete li sou kwa a. Li te di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:37">Mat 27:37</ref></char></note>“Jésus de Nazareth, Wa Jwif Yo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Konsa, anpil nan Jwif yo te li enskripsyon sila a, paske plas kote Jésus te krisifye a te prè vil la, e li te ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:13">Jn 19:13</ref></char></note>Ebre, Latin ak Grèk.<verse eid="JHN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Epi chèf prèt yo t ap di a Pilate: “Pa ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:14-19">Jn 19:14-19</ref></char></note>‘Wa Jwif yo’, men ke ‘Li te di: “Mwen se Wa Jwif yo.”’<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilate te reponn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:14">Jen 43:14</ref></char></note>“Sa ke m ekri a, mwen ekri nèt”.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat 27:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sòlda yo, lè yo te fin krisifye Jésus te pran tout vètman li epi fè kat pati. Yon pati pou chak sòlda, anplis tinik la. Konsa, tinik la te yon sèl moso twal san koud soti anwo, jis rive anba.<verse eid="JHN 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Akoz sa yo te di youn ak lòt, annou pa chire li, men tire osò pou li, pou deside pou kilès li dwe ye. Konsa, yo te akonpli Lekriti a ki te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sòm 22:18</ref></char></note>divize vètman Mwen yo pami yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">e pou rad Mwen yo tire osò.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Pou sa a, sòlda yo te fè bagay sa yo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Men manman Li, sè a manman Li, Marie, madanm a Cléopas, ak Marie <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mat 27:55</ref></char></note>Magdalène t ap kanpe prè kwa Jésus a.<verse eid="JHN 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Konsa, lè Jésus te wè manman L ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:23">Jn 13:23</ref></char></note>disip ke Li te renmen an, ki te kanpe toupre a, Li te di a manman: <char style="wj">“Fanm, men gade fis ou!” </char><verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Epi Li te di a disip la: <char style="wj">“Men gade manman ou!” </char> Depi lè sa, disip la te pran li pou rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:28">Luc 18:28</ref></char></note>tankou manm lakay li.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Apre sa Jésus, byen konnen ke tout bagay te deja acheve, pou Lekriti a ta kapab akonpli, te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sòm 69:21</ref></char></note>“Mwen swaf.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Yon bokal ranpli avèk diven si te kanpe la. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:48-50">Mat 27:48-50</ref></char></note>yo te mete yon eponj ranpli avèk diven si a sou yon branch izòp pou te lonje l anwo vè bouch Li.<verse eid="JHN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Konsa, lè Jésus te resevwa diven si a, Li te di: <char style="wj">“Li se fini!” </char> Epi Li te bese tèt Li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:50">Mat 27:50</ref></char></note>rann lespri Li.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Pou sa, Jwif yo, akoz ke se te Jou Preparasyon an, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Det 21:23</ref></char></note>kò yo pa ta dwe rete sou lakwa pandan Saba a, pwiske Saba a te yon gwo jou sen, te mande Pilate pou kase janm tout moun yo, pou yo ta kapab retire yo.<verse eid="JHN 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Konsa, sòlda yo te vini e te kase janm a premye mesye a, epi lòt ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:18">Jn 19:18</ref></char></note>krisifye avèk li a. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Men lè yo vini sou Jésus, yo te wè ke Li te deja mouri, epi yo pa t kase janm Li yo. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Men youn nan sòlda yo te frennen akote Li avèk yon lans, epi imedyatman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:6-8">I Jn 5:6-8</ref></char></note>san mele avèk dlo te soti.<verse eid="JHN 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>E sila a ki wè gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:27">Jn 15:27</ref></char></note>bay temwaye, epi temwayaj li vrè. E li konnen ke l ap di laverite, pou nou tout kapab kwè. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Paske bagay sa yo te vin pase, pou Lekriti a ta kapab akonpli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Egz 12:46</ref></char></note>“Pa menm yon zo nan Li va kase.”<verse eid="JHN 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>E ankò yon lòt Ekriti di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Za 12:10</ref></char></note>“Yo va gade sila a ke yo pèse a.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre bagay sa yo, Joseph d'Arimathée, ki te yon disip a Jésus, men an sekrè akoz perèz a Jwif yo, te mande Pilate pou l kite li pran kò Jésus. E Pilate te bay li pèmisyon.<verse eid="JHN 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nicodème ki te vini premyèman kote li nan nwit lan te vini tou. Yo t ap pote yon melanj lami avèk epis lalwa ki te peze kon pwa anviwon san liv.<verse eid="JHN 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Konsa, yo te pran kò a Jésus, epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:44">Jn 11:44</ref></char></note>vlope l avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:12">Luc 24:12</ref></char></note>twal lèn avèk epis selon koutim lantèman a Jwif yo.<verse eid="JHN 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Nan plas kote Li te krisifye a, te gen yon jaden, e nan jaden an yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:60">Mat 27:60</ref></char></note>tonm nèf kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:53">Luc 23:53</ref></char></note>pèsòn poko te poze. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Pou sa, akoz jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:14-31">Jn 19:14-31</ref></char></note>Preparasyon Jwif la, e akoz ke tonm nan te prè, yo te poze Jésus la.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, nan premye jou semèn nan, Marie a Magdala te vini nan tonm nan bonè, pandan Li te toujou fènwa, e te wè ke wòch la te deja retire sou tonm nan. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>E li te kouri vini kote Simon Pierre ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:23">Jn 13:23</ref></char></note>lòt disip ke Jésus te renmen an, e te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:13">Jn 20:13</ref></char></note>“Yo retire Senyè a nan tonm nan e nou pa konnen kote yo mete Li.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:12">Luc 24:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Pierre te soti ak lòt disip la, pou yo ale nan tonm nan.<verse eid="JHN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Yo toulède t ap kouri ansanm. E lòt disip la te kouri vit pase Pierre, e li te rive nan tonm nan avan. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Lè l bese gade ladann, li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:40">Jn 19:40</ref></char></note>twal lèn yo atè a, men li pa t antre.<verse eid="JHN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Alò, Simon Pierre t ap swiv li, epi te antre nan tonm nan. Li te wè twal lèn yo atè a, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:44">Jn 11:44</ref></char></note>twal pou figi ki te konn sou tèt Li a, pa t avèk lòt lèn yo, men te byen woule epi mete nan yon plas akote pou kont li.<verse eid="JHN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Lòt disip la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:4">Jn 20:4</ref></char></note>ki te rive nan tonm nan avan te antre osi. Li te wè, e li te kwè. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Paske jiska moman sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:29">Mat 22:29</ref></char></note>yo poko te konprann Lekriti a ke fòk Li leve ankò soti nan lanmò.<verse eid="JHN 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Konsa, disip yo te kite la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:12">Luc 24:12</ref></char></note>pou retounen nan pwòp kay pa yo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:5">Mc 16:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men Marie te kanpe deyò tonm nan. Li t ap kriye, epi konsa, pandan li t ap kriye, li te bese pou gade nan tonm nan. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>E li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:2">Mat 28:2</ref></char></note>de zanj abiye an blan ki chita, youn bò kote tèt la, e youn bò kote pye yo, kote kò Jésus te konn kouche a.<verse eid="JHN 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Yo te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:15">Jn 20:15</ref></char></note>“Fanm poukisa w ap kriye?” Li te di yo, “Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:2">Jn 20:2</ref></char></note>yo te pran Senyè m nan, e mwen pa konnen kote yo mete L.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Lè li te fin di sa, li te vire, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:9">Mat 28:9</ref></char></note>te wè Jésus t ap kanpe la, men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:4">Jn 21:4</ref></char></note>pa t konnen ke se te Jésus.<verse eid="JHN 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Jésus te di li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:13">Jn 20:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Fanm, poukisa w ap kriye? Kilès w ap chèche?” </char> Byen kwè ke Li te mèt jaden an, li te di L: “Mesye si ou te pote Li ale, di m kote ou mete Li, epi m ap pran L mennen L ale.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Marie!” </char> Li te di Li an Ebre: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:51">Mc 10:51</ref></char></note>“Rabouni!”, ki vle di “Mèt!”<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Pa touche M, paske Mwen poko monte jwenn Papa M. Men ale bò kote </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:10">Mat 28:10</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">frè M yo e di yo ke ‘Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:33">Jn 7:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">monte a Papa Mwen, e Papa pa w, Bondye Mwen, e Bondye Pa w.’” </char><verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Marie <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:10-23">Luc 24:10-23</ref></char></note>Magdala te vin kote disip yo e te anonse yo: “Mwen wè Senyè a,” epi Li te pale yo de bagay sa yo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Konsa, lè l fènwa nan menm jou sa a, premye jou nan semèn nan, lè pòt yo te fèmen kote disip yo te ye a, akoz laperèz a Jwif yo, Jésus te vini epi kanpe nan mitan yo. Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luc 24:36</ref></char></note>“Lapè avèk nou.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>E lè Li te di sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:39-40">Luc 24:39-40</ref></char></note>Li te montre yo tou de men li yo, ak akote li. Pou sa, disip yo te rejwi lè yo te wè Senyè a.<verse eid="JHN 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Pou sa, Jésus te di yo ankò: <char style="wj">“Lapè avèk nou.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:18">Jn 17:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Kon Papa a te voye M nan, osi, Mwen voye nou.” </char><verse eid="JHN 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>E lè Li te di sa, li te soufle sou yo e te di yo: <char style="wj">“Resevwa Lespri Sen an.</char><verse eid="JHN 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Si nou padonnen peche a nenpòt moun, peche yo ap gen tan padonnen. E si nou kenbe peche a nenpòt moun, y ap kenbe.” </char><verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:16">Jn 11:16</ref></char></note>Thomas, youn nan douz yo ke yo te rele Didyme, pa t avèk yo lè Jésus te vini an. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Pou sa, lòt disip yo t ap di li: “Nou gen tan wè Senyè a!” Men li te di yo: “Anmwenske m wè mak klou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:20">Jn 20:20</ref></char></note>nan men L, epi mete dwat mwen kote klou yo te ye a, e fouye men m akote L, mwen p ap kwè.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Uit jou pi tà, disip Li yo te anndan, epi Thomas te avèk yo. Jésus te vini lè pòt yo te fèmen. Li te kanpe nan mitan yo, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luc 24:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lapè avèk nou!” </char><verse eid="JHN 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Alò Li te di a Thomas <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:40">Luc 24:40</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Lonje dwat ou la, e wè men M. Epi lonje men ou la, e mete l akote Mwen e pa vin enkredil, men kwè.” </char><verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Thomas te reponn: “Senyè mwen, e Bondye mwen!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“Paske ou wè M, ou kwè?</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:8">I Pi 1:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Beni se sila yo ki pa t wè, men te kwè.” </char><verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:25">Jn 21:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, anpil lòt sign Jésus osi te fè nan prezans disip Li yo, ki pa ekri nan liv sa a. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Men sila yo te ekri pou nou kapab kwè ke Jésus se Kris la, Fis a Bondye. Epi ke nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:15">Jn 3:15</ref></char></note>kwè sa a, nou kapab gen lavi etènèl nan non Li.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, Jésus te vin parèt ankò a disip yo bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:1">Jn 6:1</ref></char></note>Lanmè Tibériade la, e se konsa li te vin parèt.<verse eid="JHN 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Yo te ansanm. Simon Pierre, Thomas, ke yo rele Didyme, e Nathanaël de Cana nan Galilée, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:21">Mat 4:21</ref></char></note>fis a Zébédée yo e de lòt nan disip Li yo.<verse eid="JHN 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simon Pierre te di yo: “M ap prale fè lapèch.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Yo te di li: “N ap prale avè w tou.” Yo ale deyò e te antre nan kannòt la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luc 5:5</ref></char></note>nwit sa a, yo pa t kenbe anyen.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Men lè bajou te kase, Jésus te kanpe arebò lanmè a, men disip yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:16">Luc 24:16</ref></char></note>pa t konnen ke se te Jésus.<verse eid="JHN 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Konsa, Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Pitit yo,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:41">Luc 24:41</ref></char></note><char style="wj">èske nou pa gen kèk grenn pwason?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Yo te reponn Li: “Non”.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>E Li te di yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:4">Luc 5:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Voye filè a sou men dwat kannòt la, e nou va kenbe kèk.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:6">Konsa, yo te voye l, e yo pa t kab rale fè l antre akoz gran kantite pwason yo.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:23">Jn 13:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, disip ke Jésus te renmen an te di Pierre: “Se Senyè a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:7">Lè Simon Pierre te tande ke se te Senyè a, li te mete vètman li, paske li te retire rad li pou travay la, e te voye kò li nan lanmè a.<verse eid="JHN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Men lòt disip yo te vini nan ti kannòt la, paske yo pa t lwen tè a, men sèlman anviwon san mèt, pou rale filè plen pwason an. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>E lè yo te desann atè, yo te wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:18">Jn 18:18</ref></char></note>dife chabon deja prepare, avèk pwason sou li, ak pen.<verse eid="JHN 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>
    <char style="wj">Jésus te di yo: “Pote kèk nan </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:9-11">Jn 6:9-11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pwason ke nou fenk kenbe yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simon Pierre te monte e te rale filè a atè a, byen plen gwo pwason, san-senkant-twa, e malgre ke te gen gran kantite sa a, filè a pa t chire.<verse eid="JHN 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Jésus te di yo: <char style="wj">“Vin pran</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15">Jn 21:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ti dejene.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:12">Okenn nan disip yo pa t tante kesyone L: “Ki Moun Ou ye?” paske yo te konnen ke se te Senyè a.<verse eid="JHN 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Jésus te vini. Li te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:9">Jn 21:9</ref></char></note>pen an, epi te bay yo, ansanm ak pwason an.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Sa koulye a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:19-26">Jn 20:19-26</ref></char></note>twazyèm fwa ke Jésus te vin parèt a disip yo, depi Li te leve soti nan lanmò a.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Konsa, lè yo te fin dejene, Jésus te di a Simon Pierre: <char style="wj">“Simon, fis a Jean,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:33">Mat 26:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">èske ou renmen M plis ke sa yo?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Li te di Li: “Wi Senyè. Ou konnen ke m renmen Ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Li te di li: “Okipe Mouton Mwen yo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Li te di li ankò yon dezyèm fwa: <char style="wj">“Simon, fis a Jean, èske ou renmen M?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Li te reponn Li: <char style="wj">“Wi Senyè, Ou konnen ke m renmen Ou.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:6">Mat 2:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Fè bèje mouton Mwen yo.” </char><verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Li te di li yon twazyèm fwa: <char style="wj">“Simon, fis a Jean, èske ou renmen M?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pierre te vin tris akoz ke Li di li yon twazyèm fwa: <char style="wj">“Èske ou renmen M?” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">E li te di Li: “Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:30">Jn 16:30</ref></char></note>Ou konnen tout bagay. Ou konnen ke Mwen renmen Ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jésus te di Li: <char style="wj">“Okipe mouton Mwen yo. </char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/><char style="wj">Anverite, anverite Mwen di ou, lè ou te pi jenn, ou te konn mare sentiwon ou, e mache kote ou te pito. Men lè ou vin vye, ou va lonje men ou epi yon lòt ap mare sentiwon ou e mennen ou kote ou pa vle ale.” </char><verse eid="JHN 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Sila Li te di pou montre pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:14">II Pi 1:14</ref></char></note>ki kalite mò li ta bay glwa a Bondye a. E lè Li te pale sa, Li te di L: <char style="wj">“Swiv Mwen!” </char><verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Pierre te vire gade pa dèyè e te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:7">Jn 21:7</ref></char></note>disip ke Jésus te renmen an t ap swiv li. Sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">Jn 13:25</ref></char></note>apiye sou sen Li nan dènye soupe a, e te di: “Senyè, kilès k ap trayi Ou a?”<verse eid="JHN 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Epi Pierre, lè l te wè li, te di a Jésus: “Senyè, e pou nonm sila a?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Jésus te di li: <char style="wj">“E si Mwen vle li rete jis lè Mwen vini, kisa sa ap ye pou ou? Ou menm,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:22">Mat 8:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">swiv Mwen!” </char><verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Konsa, pawòl sa te kouri pami tout frè yo ke disip sila a pa t ap mouri. Men Jésus pa t di li ke li pa t ap mouri, men sèlman <char style="wj">“Si Mwen vle li rete</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">jis lè Mwen vini, kisa sa ye pou ou?” </char><verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Sa se disip ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:27">Jn 15:27</ref></char></note>fè temwayaj a tout bagay sa yo, e te ekri bagay sa yo, e nou konnen ke temwayaj li vrè.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Epi genyen osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:30">Jn 20:30</ref></char></note>anpil lòt bagay ke Jésus te fè, ke si yo te ekri an detay, mwen pa sipoze ke tou lemonn ta kapab kenbe liv ki t ap ekri yo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
